              "start": 30.655,
              "duration": 15.36,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Describe the chain</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><strong>Registration list Â· risk map</strong></div><div class=\"riskChain\"><span>Registration list<small>Asset</small></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">â†’</b><span>Unauthorised download<small>Threat</small></span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sharing setting</span><strong>Anyone with link</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Exposure review</span><strong>Not yet reviewed</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Asset: the registration list</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Threat: an unauthorised person downloads it</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Vulnerability: public-link sharing</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Control: named access for organisers</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "your-digital-risk-map-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Your decision",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Help Asha identify the vulnerability. The list has value, and a download could cause harm. Which setting makes unwanted access easier? Choose a description, then test your decision.",
              "dialogue": "Find the weakness we can repair.",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 46.665,
              "duration": 11.776,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">What is the weakness?</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><strong>Registration list Â· risk map</strong></div><div class=\"riskChain\"><span>Registration list<small>Asset</small></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">â†’</b><span>Unauthorised download<small>Threat</small></span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sharing setting</span><strong>Anyone with link</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Exposure review</span><strong>Not yet reviewed</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The registration list contains information worth protecting.</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A harmful download is a possible event.</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Find the setting that makes that event easier.</span></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p><strong>Choose the vulnerability in the registration-list case.</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The registration list</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Anyone-with-link sharing</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">An unauthorised download</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "your-digital-risk-map-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "Reduce the risk",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha restricts the folder to named organisers and asks the responsible teacher to review the possible exposure. The team records what it knows and what remains uncertain. Changing permissions reduces future access; it cannot undo a copy someone already made.",
              "dialogue": "We can reduce risk without pretending it vanished.",
              "status": "Revising the plan",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 59.091,
              "duration": 17.365,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Now the team can act</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><strong>Registration list Â· risk map</strong></div><div class=\"riskChain\"><span>Registration list<small>Asset</small></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">â†’</b><span>Unauthorised download<small>Threat</small></span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sharing setting</span><strong>Named organisers only</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Exposure review</span><strong>Teacher informed Â· uncertainty recorded</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Restrict the link to named organisers</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Check what was exposed with the teacher</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Record what is known and what remains uncertain</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "your-digital-risk-map-6",
              "label": "Enter the lab",
              "title": "Enter the lab",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha also checks who can change supplier amounts and what happens if the gate laptop fails. Confidentiality, integrity and availability describe these different impacts. In the lab, build a risk chain, classify impacts and justify three priorities.",
              "dialogue": "Let us build an evidence-based risk register.",
              "status": "Ready to practise",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 77.106,
              "duration": 16.661,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Protect more than secrecy</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14.106 5.553a2 2 0 0 0 1.788 0l3.659-1.83A1 1 0 0 1 21 4.619v12.764a1 1 0 0 1-.553.894l-4.553 2.277a2 2 0 0 1-1.788 0l-4.212-2.106a2 2 0 0 0-1.788 0l-3.659 1.83A1 1 0 0 1 3 19.381V6.618a1 1 0 0 1 .553-.894l4.553-2.277a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0z\"></path><path d=\"M15 5.764v15\"></path><path d=\"M9 3.236v15\"></path></svg><strong>Registration list Â· risk map</strong></div><div class=\"riskChain\"><span>Registration list<small>Asset</small></span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">â†’</b><span>Unauthorised download<small>Threat</small></span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sharing setting</span><strong>Named organisers only</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Exposure review</span><strong>Teacher informed Â· uncertainty recorded</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Confidentiality: who can see contacts?</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Integrity: who can change amounts?</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Availability: will the gate system work?</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Next: build and prioritise your risk register</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            }
          ],
          "practice": [
            {
              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "An asset has value. A threat could harm it. A vulnerability is a weakness. A control reduces risk. Explain confidentiality, integrity and availability separately.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival team security lab",
              "prompt": "Build the festival team's first risk chain.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"illustratedActivity\"><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\" alt=\"Two students review a registration list and sharing settings at a school festival planning desk, with the festival courtyard behind them.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/><figcaption>Asha and Kabir connect the festival&#x27;s accounts, registration data and gate devices.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Festival registration list</span><select aria-label=\"Festival registration list\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Asset</option><option>Threat</option><option>Vulnerability</option><option>Control</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Someone downloads private registrations</span><select aria-label=\"Someone downloads private registrations\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Asset</option><option>Threat</option><option>Vulnerability</option><option>Control</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>The folder allows anyone with its link to view</span><select aria-label=\"The folder allows anyone with its link to view\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Asset</option><option>Threat</option><option>Vulnerability</option><option>Control</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Limit the folder to named organisers</span><select aria-label=\"Limit the folder to named organisers\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Asset</option><option>Threat</option><option>Vulnerability</option><option>Control</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this record to explain your decisions to your teacher. Your explanation is reviewed separately from the automatic checks.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "MatchTable",
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "label": "Festival registration list",
                      "answer": "Asset",
                      "why": "The list is information the team values and needs to protect."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "Someone downloads private registrations",
                      "answer": "Threat",
                      "why": "This is a harmful event that could happen."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "The folder allows anyone with its link to view",
                      "answer": "Vulnerability",
                      "why": "The open sharing setting is a weakness the threat could use."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "Limit the folder to named organisers",
                      "answer": "Control",
                      "why": "A safeguard changes who can access the asset."
                    }
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    "Asset",
                    "Threat",
                    "Vulnerability",
                    "Control"
                  ],
                  "success": "Risk chain: registration list â†’ unauthorised download â†’ public link weakness â†’ named-access control."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stage": 1,
              "brief": "An asset has value. A threat could harm it. A vulnerability is a weakness. A control reduces risk. Explain confidentiality, integrity and availability separately.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival team security lab",
              "prompt": "Match each incident to its main security impact.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Contact details become public</span><select aria-label=\"Contact details become public\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Availability</option><option>Confidentiality</option><option>Integrity</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>A supplier&#x27;s payment amount is changed without permission</span><select aria-label=\"A supplier&#x27;s payment amount is changed without permission\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Availability</option><option>Confidentiality</option><option>Integrity</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>The only registration laptop fails at the gate</span><select aria-label=\"The only registration laptop fails at the gate\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Availability</option><option>Confidentiality</option><option>Integrity</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this record to explain your decisions to your teacher. Your explanation is reviewed separately from the automatic checks.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "MatchTable",
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "label": "Contact details become public",
                      "answer": "Confidentiality",
                      "why": "Confidentiality concerns who can see information."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "A supplier's payment amount is changed without permission",
                      "answer": "Integrity",
                      "why": "Integrity concerns information staying accurate and unaltered by unauthorised people."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "The only registration laptop fails at the gate",
                      "answer": "Availability",
                      "why": "Availability concerns being able to use a service when needed."
                    }
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    "Availability",
                    "Confidentiality",
                    "Integrity"
                  ],
                  "success": "Impact map: public contacts threaten confidentiality; changed payments threaten integrity; laptop failure threatens availability."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "An asset has value. A threat could harm it. A vulnerability is a weakness. A control reduces risk. Explain confidentiality, integrity and availability separately.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival team security lab",
              "prompt": "Prioritise three risks and justify each one with evidence.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">For this exercise, priority score = likelihood Ã— impact, each rated 1â€“3. Put the highest score first and attach the matching evidence. These supplied ratings are estimates.</p><ol class=\"rankList\"><li><div><strong>One editable poster copy</strong><span>Likelihood 1 Â· Impact 2 Â· Score 2</span><label>Supporting evidence<select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose evidenceâ€¦</option><option value=\"folder\">Personal details are already accessible through the public link.</option><option value=\"laptop\">A device failure could stop entry and there is no tested fallback.</option><option value=\"poster\">An unwanted edit is possible, but the approved original can be restored.</option></select></label></div><div class=\"move\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Move One editable poster copy up\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"></path><path d=\"M12 19V5\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Move One editable poster copy down\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></button></div></li><li><div><strong>Public registration folder</strong><span>Likelihood 3 Â· Impact 3 Â· Score 9</span><label>Supporting evidence<select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose evidenceâ€¦</option><option value=\"folder\">Personal details are already accessible through the public link.</option><option value=\"laptop\">A device failure could stop entry and there is no tested fallback.</option><option value=\"poster\">An unwanted edit is possible, but the approved original can be restored.</option></select></label></div><div class=\"move\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Move Public registration folder up\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"></path><path d=\"M12 19V5\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Move Public registration folder down\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></button></div></li><li><div><strong>Single gate laptop, no backup</strong><span>Likelihood 2 Â· Impact 3 Â· Score 6</span><label>Supporting evidence<select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose evidenceâ€¦</option><option value=\"folder\">Personal details are already accessible through the public link.</option><option value=\"laptop\">A device failure could stop entry and there is no tested fallback.</option><option value=\"poster\">An unwanted edit is possible, but the approved original can be restored.</option></select></label></div><div class=\"move\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Move Single gate laptop, no backup up\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up\"><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"></path><path d=\"M12 19V5\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Move Single gate laptop, no backup down\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-down\"><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path><path d=\"m19 12-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg></button></div></li></ol><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>Save risk register</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this record to explain your decisions to your teacher. Your explanation is reviewed separately from the automatic checks.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
