            "familyAction": "Review how a fictional account would be recovered after a lost phone. Keep all real credentials private."
          },
          "title": "Kabir's missing sign-in phone",
          "character": "Kabir",
          "beginLabel": "Enter the security lab",
          "waitingText": "Story paused. Test your decision to continue.",
          "lockedHint": "Complete the festival team's decision first.",
          "source": "app/module/cyber/lessons/new/story/chapters/identity-beyond-a-password.json",
          "duration": 91.388,
          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "identity-beyond-a-password-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "Meet Kabir",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir uses an individual festival account. His password manager stores a unique password, and his phone provides another sign-in factor. The team is ready until the phone goes missing.",
              "dialogue": "My account needs a recovery plan too.",
              "status": "Planning the festival",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 12.395,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/account-access.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The festival account needs its organiser</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/account-access.webp\" alt=\"A student reviews people and folder permissions on a laptop beside a sign-in phone, a separate envelope and a locked drawer.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>The team reviews who can sign in, what they can open and how access can be recovered privately.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "identity-beyond-a-password-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Phone missing",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "Kabir cannot use the missing phone. His account has a recovery code, but a screenshot stored only on that phone would be unavailable too. Posting the code to the team group would give other people a powerful account key.",
              "dialogue": "Where can I recover access privately?",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 13.045,
              "duration": 14.037,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The phone is missing</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Kabir Â· festival account</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Password manager</span><strong>Unique password Â· private</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sign-in phone</span><strong>Missing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Independent recovery</span><strong>Private code available</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Kabir still knows the official service address</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>A recovery code exists</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>But where was that code stored?</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "identity-beyond-a-password-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Protect recovery",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "A long unique password limits reuse risk. M F A or a supported passkey adds sign-in protection. Recovery options must remain private and available after a device is lost. Protecting sign-in and planning recovery are part of one design.",
              "dialogue": "The spare key must survive losing the main key.",
              "status": "Thinking it through",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 27.732,
              "duration": 16.853,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Plan for losing the sign-in device</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Kabir Â· festival account</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Password manager</span><strong>Unique password Â· private</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sign-in phone</span><strong>Missing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Independent recovery</span><strong>Private code available</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Password: long and unique</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>MFA or a supported passkey: stronger sign-in</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Recovery: private and available independently of the lost phone</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "identity-beyond-a-password-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Your decision",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Choose storage for a fictional recovery code. The sign-in phone is unavailable and the festival group includes people who should not control this account. Find a route that remains private and usable.",
              "dialogue": "Choose the recovery route that still works.",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 45.235,
              "duration": 12.949,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose a usable recovery route</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Kabir Â· festival account</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Password manager</span><strong>Unique password Â· private</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sign-in phone</span><strong>Missing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Independent recovery</span><strong>Private code available</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The old phone is unavailable</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The team group includes suppliers</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>An offline recovery code is stored privately</span></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p><strong>Where should a recovery code be available if the sign-in phone is lost?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Only in a screenshot on that phone</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">In the festival&#x27;s public group</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">In private storage independent of that phone</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "identity-beyond-a-password-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "Recover safely",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir opens the known provider recovery page on a trusted device and proves ownership using a private recovery method. He reviews and revokes the lost device sessions, then registers a replacement method and refreshes recovery options.",
              "dialogue": "Getting back in is not the last step.",
              "status": "Revising the plan",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 58.835,
              "duration": 15.467,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Recover, then review</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-key-round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.586 17.414A2 2 0 0 0 2 18.828V21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h1a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h.172a2 2 0 0 0 1.414-.586l.814-.814a6.5 6.5 0 1 0-4-4z\"></path><circle cx=\"16.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg><strong>Kabir Â· festival account</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Password manager</span><strong>Unique password Â· private</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sign-in phone</span><strong>Old sessions revoked</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Independent recovery</span><strong>Used privately Â· refreshed</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><