          "title": "Asha's open festival folder",
          "character": "Asha",
          "beginLabel": "Enter the security lab",
          "waitingText": "Story paused. Test your decision to continue.",
          "lockedHint": "Complete the festival team's decision first.",
          "source": "app/module/cyber/lessons/new/story/chapters/who-should-have-access.json",
          "duration": 84.689,
          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "who-should-have-access-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "The shared drive",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha manages registrations, a teacher reads progress and a supplier delivers equipment. Their tasks are different. The festival drive should give each person only the information and actions needed for their task.",
              "dialogue": "Different jobs need different permissions.",
              "status": "Planning the festival",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 14.059,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/account-access.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"5\" x=\"14\" y=\"17\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M10 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2.5\"></path><path d=\"M20 17v-2a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Fest Team Drive</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/account-access.webp\" alt=\"A student reviews people and folder permissions on a laptop beside a sign-in phone, a separate envelope and a locked drawer.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>The team reviews who can sign in, what they can open and how access can be recovered privately.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "who-should-have-access-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Too much access",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The team made everyone an editor. A supplier can read private contacts and a guest can change the registration file. Dev has left the team, but the organiser group still includes his account.",
              "dialogue": "A link can grant more access than we intended.",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 14.709,
              "duration": 12.395,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"5\" x=\"14\" y=\"17\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M10 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2.5\"></path><path d=\"M20 17v-2a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Everyone was made an editor</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-lock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"5\" x=\"14\" y=\"17\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M10 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2.5\"></path><path d=\"M20 17v-2a2 2 0 1 0-4 0v2\"></path></svg><strong>Fest Team Drive</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Asha</span><strong>Edit registrations</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Teacher</span><strong>Edit everything</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Supplier</span><strong>Edit registrations</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Dev Â· departed</span><strong>Organiser group: active</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Supplier: can read contact details</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Guest: can change the registration file</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Former organiser Dev: still in the organiser group</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "who-should-have-access-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Least privilege",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Asha needs edit access. The oversight teacher needs view access. The supplier does not need registration data. A guest can receive a separate programme link that expires after the event. Start with the task, then choose the permission.",
              "dialogue": "Only the access needed, only while needed.",
              "status": "Thinking it through",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 27.753,
              "duration": 15.232,
