              "brief": "Read the full hostname and check the task. HTTPS protects a connection but does not prove that a site is legitimate. Every address in this exercise is fictional.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival team security lab",
              "prompt": "You typed the school's known address yourself. Identify the hostname and check the permissions request.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"browser\"><div class=\"address\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><code>https://cyberpurschool.example/events</code></div><div class=\"webpage\"><span>Fictional school festival</span><h3>View the programme</h3><p>This page asks for access to all your contacts.</p><strong>Known school hostname: cyberpurschool.example</strong></div></div><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Actual hostname</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Inspect the addressâ€¦</option><option>events</option><option>cyberpurschool.example</option><option>School Festival</option></select></label><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Allow contacts so the programme will load</button><button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Decline contacts; the programme does not need them</button></div><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Record browser evidence</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this record to explain your decisions to your teacher. Your explanation is reviewed separately from the automatic checks.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            }
          ],
          "decisionTask": {
            "title": "Kabir inspects the address bar",
            "icon": {},
            "panels": [
              {
                "heading": "A programme link arrives",
                "facts": [
                  "Display title: Cyberpur School Festival",
                  "A familiar crest appears",
                  "The page asks Kabir to sign in"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "Read beyond the familiar words",
                "facts": [
                  "https://cyberpurschool.example.verify-event.example/login",
                  "Known school host: cyberpurschool.example",
                  "A familiar word can appear inside a different hostname"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "A connection is not an endorsement",
                "facts": [
                  "HTTPS protects the connection to the shown hostname",
                  "The site operator can still be untrustworthy",
                  "Verify through an independently known school route"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "Which address did the browser open?",
                "facts": [
                  "Hostname comes after https:// and before the next slash",
                  "Do not use the page heading as the address",
                  "Compare the complete hostname"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "Kabir takes an independent route",
                "facts": [
                  "He uses the address from the school diary",
                  "He checks with the school rather than replying to the sender",
                  "He does not enter credentials into the supplied page"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "Check permissions too",
                "facts": [
                  "A programme page does not need the contact list",
                  "Connection clues have limits",
                  "Next: inspect three fictional browser cases"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "task": "Which hostname is actually in the supplied address bar?",
            "choices": [
              {
                "label": "cyberpurschool.example",
                "why": "That is only the familiar beginning. Read through to the next slash."
              },
              {
                "label": "cyberpurschool.example.verify-event.example",
                "correct": true,
                "why": "That full hostname differs from the known school host."
              },
              {
                "label": "Cyberpur School Festival",
                "why": "That is a page title, which its author can choose."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lesson": {
            "id": "cyber-class-11-data-has-a-lifecycle",
            "slug": "data-has-a-lifecycle",
            "title": "Data has a lifecycle",
            "band": "upper",
            "grades": [
              11
            ],
            "strand": "Cybersecurity",
            "summary": "Choose what to collect, where to store it, who may see it and when to delete it.",
            "primaryMechanic": "data-lifecycle-editor",
            "openingPattern": "data-has-a-lifecycle-story",
            "completionPattern": "data-has-a-lifecycle-evidence",
            "accent": "mint",
            "durationMinutes": 40,
            "assessmentIds": [
              "data-has-a-lifecycle-check-1",
              "data-has-a-lifecycle-check-2",
              "data-has-a-lifecycle-transfer"
            ],
            "familyAction": "Ask what information a form really needs and how long it should be kept. Use fictional examples."
          },
          "title": "Asha trims the registration form",
          "character": "Asha",
          "beginLabel": "Enter the security lab",
          "waitingText": "Story paused. Test your decision to continue.",
          "lockedHint": "Complete the festival team's decision first.",
          "source": "app/module/cyber/lessons/new/story/chapters/data-has-a-lifecycle.json",
          "duration": 90.428,
          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "data-has-a-lifecycle-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "The long form",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha creates a form to send programme updates through school email. The draft also asks for a home address, an identity document and bank details. Each extra field creates another record that would need protection.",
              "dialogue": "What does our actual purpose require?",
              "status": "Planning the festival",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 14.037,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A form for programme updates</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\" alt=\"Two students review a registration list and sharing settings at a school festival planning desk, with the festival courtyard behind them.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Asha and Kabir connect the festival&#x27;s accounts, registration data and gate devices.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "data-has-a-lifecycle-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Unneeded details",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "Email updates do not require a home address or an identity scan. No payment is involved, so bank details are unnecessary too. A field should not be collected merely because it might be useful someday.",
              "dialogue": "We can run this event with less personal data.",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 14.687,
              "duration": 13.952,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">More data is not automatically better</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Programme updates Â· draft form</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>School email</span><strong>student@school.example</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Home address</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Government ID scan</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Bank details</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Home address is unrelated to email updates</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>ID scans are unnecessary for the stated purpose</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Bank details are unnecessary when no payment is involved</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "data-has-a-lifecycle-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "The lifecycle",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Decide what to collect, how to store it, who needs access and when its purpose ends. Restrict sensitive details to the roles that need them. Retention depends on the purpose and applicable policy, including authorised holds for relevant records.",
              "dialogue": "Collection is only the first decision.",
              "status": "Thinking it through",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 29.289,
              "duration": 15.637,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Follow data through its lifecycle</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Programme updates Â· draft form</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>School email</span><strong>student@school.example</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Home address</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Government ID scan</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Bank details</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Collect only what the purpose requires</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Store it with restricted access</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Set a justified retention plan</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Delete or anonymise when the purpose ends, subject to authorised holds</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "data-has-a-lifecycle-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Your decision",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The form only sends programme updates. No delivery, identity check or payment is part of its purpose. Choose the field needed to do this job and test your decision.",
              "dialogue": "Keep the necessary contact channel.",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 45.577,
              "duration": 11.307,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Keep only a necessary field</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Programme updates Â· draft form</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>School email</span><strong>student@school.example</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Home address</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Government ID scan</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>Bank details</span><strong>Requested in draft</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The team only sends programme updates</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The contact channel is school email</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>No delivery, identity check or payment is part of this form</span></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p><strong>Which field does this programme-update form need?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Government ID scan</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">School email</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Bank account details</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "data-has-a-lifecycle-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "The smaller form",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha keeps school email for updates and removes the unrelated fields. Only the named registration team can use the contact list. The team records its purpose so later access and retention choices have a clear reason.",
              "dialogue": "A smaller form still serves our students.",
              "status": "Revising the plan",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 57.533,
              "duration": 14.976,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The smaller form still works</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Programme updates Â· draft form</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>School email</span><strong>student@school.example</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"true\"><span>Home address</span><strong>Removed: unnecessary</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"true\"><span>Government ID scan</span><strong>Removed: unnecessary</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"true\"><span>Bank details</span><strong>Removed: unnecessary</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>School email: collected for updates</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Home address, ID and bank fields: removed</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Registration team access: restricted</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "data-has-a-lifecycle-6",
              "label": "Enter the lab",
              "title": "Enter the lab",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "After follow-up ends, apply the exercise retention plan. Anonymous attendance totals can support planning. Relevant records for an active complaint need restricted authorised review. In the lab, make collection, audience and end-of-purpose decisions.",
              "dialogue": "Let us follow the records through their whole lifecycle.",
              "status": "Ready to practise",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 73.159,
              "duration": 16.619,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The festival ends. Data needs a decision.</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Programme updates Â· draft form</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"false\"><span>School email</span><strong>student@school.example</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"true\"><span>Home address</span><strong>Removed: unnecessary</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"true\"><span>Government ID scan</span><strong>Removed: unnecessary</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\" data-removed=\"true\"><span>Bank details</span><strong>Removed: unnecessary</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Completed follow-up: apply the stated deletion plan</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Planning: prefer anonymous totals</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Active complaint: restrict relevant records for authorised review</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Next: build, restrict and retire a fictional dataset</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            }
