              "prompt": "Build a minimal festival sign-up form for programme updates.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Festival data desk</strong></div><p class=\"callout\">Send programme updates to students through their school email.</p><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>School email</span><select aria-label=\"School email\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Collect</option><option>Do not collect</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Home address</span><select aria-label=\"Home address\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Collect</option><option>Do not collect</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Government ID scan</span><select aria-label=\"Government ID scan\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Collect</option><option>Do not collect</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Bank details</span><select aria-label=\"Bank details\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Collect</option><option>Do not collect</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></div></section>",
