            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Follow the purpose from collection through storage, access and deletion. Collect less and restrict access. Apply the supplied exercise policy; retention periods depend on context.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival team security lab",
              "prompt": "The festival is over. Apply this fictional school's stated retention plan.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><strong>Festival data desk</strong></div><p class=\"callout\">For this exercise: remove contact exports after follow-up ends; retain the anonymous attendance total; hold records relevant to an active complaint for authorised review.</p><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Contact export Â· follow-up finished</span><select aria-label=\"Contact export Â· follow-up finished\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Delete securely</option><option>Keep anonymous summary</option><option>Restrict and review</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Anonymous attendance total</span><select aria-label=\"Anonymous attendance total\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Delete securely</option><option>Keep anonymous summary</option><option>Restrict and review</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Records relevant to an active complaint</span><select aria-label=\"Records relevant to an active complaint\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Delete securely</option><option>Keep anonymous summary</option><option>Restrict and review</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this record to explain your decisions to your teacher. Your explanation is reviewed separately from the automatic checks.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "MatchTable",
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "label": "Contact export Â· follow-up finished",
                      "answer": "Delete securely",
                      "why": "Its stated purpose has ended and the exercise policy calls for removal."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "Anonymous attendance total",
                      "answer": "Keep anonymous summary",
                      "why": "The total supports planning without retaining identifiable records."
                    },
                    {
