                    "Keep anonymous summary",
                    "Restrict and review"
                  ],
                  "success": "Data decision: Contact export Â· follow-up finished â†’ Delete securely; Anonymous attendance total â†’ Keep anonymous summary; Records relevant to an active complaint â†’ Restrict and review. Decisions follow the stated purpose and exercise policy."
                }
