              "devices-updates-and-backups-check-2",
              "devices-updates-and-backups-transfer"
            ],
            "familyAction": "Explain how a backup can fail and why a restoration test matters. Never delete originals for practice."
          },
          "title": "The gate laptop stops working",
          "character": "Kabir",
          "beginLabel": "Enter the security lab",
          "waitingText": "Story paused. Test your decision to continue.",
          "lockedHint": "Complete the festival team's decision first.",
          "source": "app/module/cyber/lessons/new/story/chapters/devices-updates-and-backups.json",
          "duration": 90.3,
          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "devices-updates-and-backups-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "At the gate",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The festival gate team needs a readable list of forty-two registrations. One shared laptop holds the working copy. Having a file somewhere is not enough if the right person cannot use it when visitors arrive.",
              "dialogue": "Will the list still be usable after a failure?",
              "status": "Planning the festival",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 14.165,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/gate-recovery.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Visitors arrive at the festival</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/gate-recovery.webp\" alt=\"Two students at a school festival gate check a restored registration list using a laptop and a connected external backup drive.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A separate backup helps the gate team restore its registration list and check the result.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "devices-updates-and-backups-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "The empty file",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "At ten thirty, the working file becomes empty. Sync copies that empty state. A duplicate on the same failed laptop may be unavailable too. A separate version from ten o clock still contains the expected registrations.",
              "dialogue": "The newest copy may contain the same damage.",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 14.815,
              "duration": 15.104,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">At 10:30, the working file becomes empty</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Registration recovery desk</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Working laptop</span><strong>0 records Â· corrupted</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Newest synced copy</span><strong>0 records Â· same corruption</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate 10:00 version</span><strong>42 records Â· available</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>A duplicate on the same laptop may share its failure</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Sync has copied the empty file</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>A separate 10:00 version still has 42 records</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "devices-updates-and-backups-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Recoverable copies",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Separate backups can survive a device failure. Version history can recover a state before corruption. A restoration test checks that the contents are readable, complete and accessible. Preserve the original and restore a practice duplicate to a new folder.",
              "dialogue": "Test restoration, not just the backup icon.",
              "status": "Thinking it through",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 30.569,
              "duration": 16.597,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A backup must be recoverable</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Registration recovery desk</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Working laptop</span><strong>0 records Â· corrupted</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Newest synced copy</span><strong>0 records Â· same corruption</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate 10:00 version</span><strong>42 records Â· available</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Separate copy: survives a device failure</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Versions: can recover before corruption</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Restoration test: checks contents and access</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Preserve the original while practising</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "devices-updates-and-backups-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Your decision",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The corruption began at ten thirty. Compare the unavailable local duplicate, the newest empty synced file and the separate earlier version. Choose the first recovery point to test.",
              "dialogue": "Which copy can give us a usable independent fallback?",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 47.817,
              "duration": 11.733,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose a recovery point</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Registration recovery desk</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Working laptop</span><strong>0 records Â· corrupted</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Newest synced copy</span><strong>0 records Â· same corruption</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate 10:00 version</span><strong>42 records Â· available</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Corruption began at 10:30</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Newest synced copy: 0 records</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Separate 10:00 version: 42 records</span></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p><strong>Which copy should the team test first after the 10:30 corruption?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The newest synced empty file</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A duplicate on the unavailable laptop</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The separate 10:00 version with 42 records</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "devices-updates-and-backups-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "Test the restore",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The team restores the separate earlier version to a new folder. It checks the expected forty-two records and tests access with the gate account. The original remains untouched and the restoration result is recorded.",
              "dialogue": "Now we have evidence that recovery worked.",
              "status": "Revising the plan",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 60.2,
              "duration": 13.973,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/gate-recovery.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Restore to a new folder</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/gate-recovery.webp\" alt=\"Two students at a school festival gate check a restored registration list using a laptop and a connected external backup drive.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A separate backup helps the gate team restore its registration list and check the result.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "devices-updates-and-backups-6",
              "label": "Enter the lab",
              "title": "Enter the lab",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The team also uses trusted updates, individual accounts and a screen lock. These controls address different risks. In the lab, repair the device plan, restore a fictional file and decide how to verify a different recovery case.",
              "dialogue": "Protect the device and rehearse the fallback.",
              "status": "Ready to practise",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 74.823,
              "duration": 14.827,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Protect the device before the next event</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Registration recovery desk</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Working laptop</span><strong>0 records Â· corrupted</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Newest synced copy</span><strong>0 records Â· same corruption</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate 10:00 version</span><strong>Restored Â· 42 records verified</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Use trusted updates and individual accounts</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Lock unattended sessions</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Next: repair settings and test two recovery cases</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            }
          ],
          "practice": [
            {
              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "Trusted updates, locks and recoverable backups address different risks. A synced copy may repeat damage. Restore a duplicate and verify its contents and access.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival team security lab",
              "prompt": "Repair the shared laptop's protection plan.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Install updates from the device&#x27;s trusted update service</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Turn on screen lock and use individual accounts</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Keep a separate, versioned backup and test restoration</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Install the security patch attached to an unknown message</span></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Test protection</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this record to explain your decisions to your teacher. Your explanation is reviewed separately from the automatic checks.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ControlChecklist",
                  "controls": [
                    {
                      "id": "updates",
                      "label": "Install updates from the device's trusted update service",
                      "good": true,
                      "why": "Trusted updates can repair known weaknesses."
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "lock",
                      "label": "Turn on screen lock and use individual accounts",
                      "good": true,
                      "why": "An unattended shared device should not expose an active account."
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "backup",
                      "label": "Keep a separate, versioned backup and test restoration",
                      "good": true,
                      "why": "A backup needs to survive the same failure and produce a usable restored copy."
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "download",
                      "label": "Install the security patch attached to an unknown message",
                      "good": false,
                      "why": "A message attachment is not a trusted software update source."
                    }
                  ],
                  "success": "Device plan: trusted updates, individual locked accounts, a separate versioned backup and a restoration test."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stage": 1,
              "brief": "Trusted updates, locks and recoverable backups address different risks. A synced copy may repeat damage. Restore a duplicate and verify its contents and access.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival team security lab",
              "prompt": "The registration file was corrupted. Recover a usable copy.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"illustratedActivity\"><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/gate-recovery.webp\" alt=\"Two students at a school festival gate check a restored registration list using a laptop and a connected external backup drive.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/><figcaption>A separate backup helps the gate team restore its registration list and check the result.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hard-drive\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"22\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><path d=\"M5.45 5.11 2 12v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-6l-3.45-6.89A2 2 0 0 0 16.76 4H7.24a2 2 0 0 0-1.79 1.11z\"></path><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line><line x1=\"10\" x2=\"10.01\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg><strong>Restore a fictional duplicate</strong></div><p class=\"callout\">At 10:30 the working file became empty. The expected count before corruption was 42 registrations. Choose a separate recoverable copy; keep the original evidence.</p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">11:00 Â· duplicate on the failed laptop</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">10:00 Â· separate backup Â· 42 valid registrations</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">11:00 Â· synced copy Â· 0 registrations</button></div><button class=\"secondary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg>Restore to a new practice folder</button><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Verify restoration</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this record to explain your decisions to your teacher. Your explanation is reviewed separately from the automatic checks.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            },
            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Trusted updates, locks and recoverable backups address different risks. A synced copy may repeat damage. Restore a duplicate and verify its contents and access.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival team security lab",
              "prompt": "A different gate export should have 43 records. What proves recovery?",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">New case: the gate export should have 43 registrations. The restored file opens, and its last rows are shown below. Decide what to check before declaring recovery.</p><ul class=\"records\"><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>REG-041 Â· Mira Â· confirmed</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>REG-042 Â· Aman Â· confirmed</li><li><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>REG-043 Â· Jo Â· confirmed</li></ul><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Compare all 43 expected IDs and statuses</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Test that the gate account can read the restored copy</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Declare success because the file icon exists</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Keep the original and record the restoration result</span></label><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Approve recovery checks</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this record to explain your decisions to your teacher. Your explanation is reviewed separately from the automatic checks.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            }
          ],
          "decisionTask": {
            "title": "The gate laptop stops working",
            "icon": {},
            "panels": [
              {
                "heading": "Visitors arrive at the festival",
                "facts": [
                  "The gate needs a readable registration list",
                  "The team shares one laptop",
                  "The expected list has 42 registrations"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "At 10:30, the working file becomes empty",
                "facts": [
                  "A duplicate on the same laptop may share its failure",
                  "Sync has copied the empty file",
                  "A separate 10:00 version still has 42 records"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "A backup must be recoverable",
                "facts": [
                  "Separate copy: survives a device failure",
                  "Versions: can recover before corruption",
                  "Restoration test: checks contents and access",
                  "Preserve the original while practising"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "Choose a recovery point",
                "facts": [
                  "Corruption began at 10:30",
                  "Newest synced copy: 0 records",
                  "Separate 10:00 version: 42 records"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "Restore to a new folder",
                "facts": [
                  "The separate 10:00 version opens",
                  "42 expected registrations are checked",
                  "The gate account's access is tested",
                  "The original is preserved"
                ]
              },
              {
                "heading": "Protect the device before the next event",
                "facts": [
                  "Use trusted updates and individual accounts",
                  "Lock unattended sessions",
                  "Next: repair settings and test two recovery cases"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "task": "Which copy should the team test first after the 10:30 corruption?",
            "choices": [
              {
                "label": "The newest synced empty file",
                "why": "Sync copied the corruption. Newest is not necessarily usable."
              },
              {
                "label": "A duplicate on the unavailable laptop",
                "why": "A copy on the failed device cannot provide an independent fallback."
              },
              {
                "label": "The separate 10:00 version with 42 records",
                "correct": true,
                "why": "It predates the corruption and can be restored independently."
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lesson": {
            "id": "cyber-class-11-the-suspicious-login",
            "slug": "the-suspicious-login",
            "title": "The suspicious login",
            "band": "upper",
            "grades": [
              11
            ],
            "strand": "Cybersecurity",
            "summary": "Distinguish an indicator from proof; sequence safe initial actions and escalation.",
            "primaryMechanic": "login-timeline-investigator",
            "openingPattern": "the-suspicious-login-story",
            "completionPattern": "the-suspicious-login-evidence",
            "accent": "mint",
            "durationMinutes": 40,
            "assessmentIds": [
              "the-suspicious-login-check-1",
              "the-suspicious-login-check-2",
              "the-suspicious-login-transfer"
            ],
            "familyAction": "Explain which login details are observations and which are hypotheses. Ask an account owner before taking real action."
