            {
              "id": "the-suspicious-login-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "An account alert",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir reviews a supplied sign-in alert. A recognised school-laptop sign-in is followed by an unfamiliar session with a different city label. The new event needs attention, but the city label alone does not identify anyone.",
              "dialogue": "An indicator needs checking.",
              "status": "Planning the festival",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 15.168,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/account-access.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A sign-in notification arrives</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/account-access.webp\" alt=\"A student reviews people and folder permissions on a laptop beside a sign-in phone, a separate envelope and a locked drawer.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>The team reviews who can sign in, what they can open and how access can be recovered privately.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-suspicious-login-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "A download follows",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The unfamiliar session downloads the registration file at nine fourteen. At nine twenty, Asha says she does not recognise that session. These observations support a careful response without an accusation about a particular student.",
              "dialogue": "Put the events in order before choosing an explanation.",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.818,
              "duration": 15.381,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The unfamiliar session downloads a file</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><strong>Supplied account events</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><time>09:00</time><span>Asha signs in on the school laptop; MFA succeeds.</span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><time>09:12</time><span>A sign-in from an unfamiliar device succeeds; its city label differs.</span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><time>09:14</time><span>The unfamiliar session downloads registrations.csv.</span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><time>09:20</time><span>Asha says she does not recognise the unfamiliar session.</span></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>09:14 Â· registrations.csv downloaded</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>09:20 Â· Asha does not recognise the session</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>The team needs to act without accusing someone</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
