            {
              "id": "the-suspicious-login-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Facts and hypotheses",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "An observation describes what a supplied record says. A hypothesis is a possible explanation to verify. An unsupported conclusion goes beyond the evidence. Location labels can be approximate, and records may not tell the whole story.",
              "dialogue": "Say what we know, and what we still need to check.",
              "status": "Thinking it through",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 31.849,
              "duration": 15.957,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Keep three kinds of statement separate</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg><strong>Supplied account events</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><time>09:00</time><span>Asha signs in on the school laptop; MFA succeeds.</span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><time>09:12</time><span>A sign-in from an unfamiliar device succeeds; its city label differs.</span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><time>09:14</time><span>The unfamiliar session downloads registrations.csv.</span></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><time>09:20</time><span>Asha says she does not recognise the unfamiliar session.</span></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Observation: what the supplied record says</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Hypothesis: a possible explanation to verify</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Unsupported claim: a conclusion the evidence cannot establish</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
