"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>An unfamiliar session merits checking</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>No supplied record identifies a particular student</span></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p><strong>A city label differs. Which conclusion is supported?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">It proves a particular student stole the file</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">It is an indicator to verify with other evidence</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Delete the logs before anyone sees them</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
