            "familyAction": "Explain one control your team chose, its cost and a risk it still cannot remove."
          },
          "title": "The festival team's security hearing",
          "character": "Kabir",
          "beginLabel": "Enter the security lab",
          "waitingText": "Story paused. Test your decision to continue.",
          "lockedHint": "Complete the festival team's decision first.",
          "source": "app/module/cyber/lessons/new/story/chapters/security-design-review.json",
          "duration": 92.028,
          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "security-design-review-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "The hearing",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The festival team presents its security plan. Three priorities need attention: a public registration folder, a possible gate-laptop failure and a stolen password. The team has six exercise tokens to spend on controls.",
              "dialogue": "Can we justify every control we choose?",
              "status": "Planning the festival",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 15.253,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The team presents its plan</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\" alt=\"Two students review a registration list and sharing settings at a school festival planning desk, with the festival courtyard behind them.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Asha and Kabir connect the festival&#x27;s accounts, registration data and gate devices.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "security-design-review-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "The budget",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "Named access, a tested separate backup and protected individual accounts each cost two tokens. A poster redesign also costs two. A good design spends the available budget on the stated risks rather than unrelated improvements.",
              "dialogue": "A useful change must address the actual failure mode.",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.903,
              "duration": 15.872,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Every choice has a cost</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Security budget Â· 6 tokens</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Named access and prompt removal of former members</span><strong>Cost: 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate backup with a restoration test</span><strong>Cost: 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Individual accounts, MFA and private recovery</span><strong>Cost: 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Redesign the festival poster</span><strong>Cost: 2</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Named access: 2 tokens</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Tested separate backup: 2 tokens</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Protected individual accounts: 2 tokens</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Poster redesign: 2 tokens</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "security-design-review-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Match the control",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Access restrictions reduce unwanted exposure. Recoverable backups support continuity after a failure. Stronger sign-in and private recovery protect accounts. Each control has a purpose, and none can remove every remaining risk.",
              "dialogue": "A backup cannot close an open sharing link.",
              "status": "Thinking it through",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 32.425,
              "duration": 15.68,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Match controls to failure modes</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Security budget Â· 6 tokens</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Named access and prompt removal of former members</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate backup with a restoration test</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Individual accounts, MFA and private recovery</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Redesign the festival poster</span><strong>Cost: 2</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Named access â†’ reduces public exposure</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Tested backup â†’ supports recovery</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>MFA and recovery â†’ protect sign-in</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>No control removes every risk</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "security-design-review-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Your decision",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The registration folder is open through a public link. Choose the control that directly reduces this exposure. Consider what the control changes rather than whether its name sounds secure.",
              "dialogue": "Which choice changes who can reach the data?",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 48.755,
              "duration": 12.501,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Does the backup protect confidentiality?</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Security budget Â· 6 tokens</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Named access and prompt removal of former members</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate backup with a restoration test</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Individual accounts, MFA and private recovery</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Redesign the festival poster</span><strong>Cost: 2</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A backup can recover lost information</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>It does not remove a public sharing link</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>The exposed folder needs an access-control change</span></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p><strong>Which control directly reduces a public registration-folder exposure?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A tested backup alone</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A more colourful poster</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Named access and review of sharing links</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "security-design-review-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "New evidence",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The gate laptop is lost while an organiser session remains active. M F A does not automatically close that session. The team needs to revoke access, assess exposure with the teacher and test its separate backup.",
              "dialogue": "Our plan needs a response to this new event.",
              "status": "Revising the plan",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 61.907,
              "duration": 14.571,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">New evidence arrives</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Security budget Â· 6 tokens</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Named access and prompt removal of former members</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate backup with a restoration test</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Individual accounts, MFA and private recovery</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Redesign the festival poster</span><strong>Cost: 2</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A laptop is lost with an active session</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>MFA does not automatically end that session</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Revoke access, assess exposure and verify the backup with the teacher</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "security-design-review-6",
              "label": "Enter the lab",
              "title": "Enter the lab",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Defend the plan with its budget, evidence and limitations. Explain a remaining risk and revise after a changed case. In the lab, complete the design review that brings together the whole Cybersecurity module.",
              "dialogue": "A defensible design includes the risks it cannot eliminate.",
              "status": "Ready to practise",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 77.127,
              "duration": 14.251,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 festival team</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Defend the design, including its limits</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Security budget Â· 6 tokens</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Named access and prompt removal of former members</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate backup with a restoration test</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Individual accounts, MFA and private recovery</span><strong>Selected Â· 2</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Redesign the festival poster</span><strong>Cost: 2</strong></div></div><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Explain each control and its cost</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Name one remaining risk</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Revise the design when evidence changes</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Next: complete the module&#x27;s design review</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and accounts. No personal credentials are needed.</small></div>"
