          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "is-ai-needed-here-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "A new helper",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha and Kabir are planning a waste-sorting helper for the school festival. Some jobs need a prediction, some need clear rules, and some need a written draft. They start with the task rather than choosing AI first.",
              "dialogue": "What are we actually trying to do?",
              "status": "Planning the experiment",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 13.739,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8V4H8\"></path><rect width=\"16\" height=\"12\" x=\"4\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M2 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 13v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A new helper</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\" alt=\"Two students plan a school festival using a laptop, notebooks and project folders.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Start with the task, the people using it and a testable definition of success.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "is-ai-needed-here-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "One tool for everything?",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "A proposed assistant would calculate bills, identify materials from pictures and write volunteer messages. These tasks have different needs. An exact calculation should follow the stated arithmetic rule; a polished sentence is not evidence that its claims are true.",
              "dialogue": "An impressive answer can still be the wrong tool.",
              "status": "Checking the problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 14.389,
              "duration": 17.237,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8V4H8\"></path><rect width=\"16\" height=\"12\" x=\"4\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M2 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 13v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">One tool for everything?</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg><strong>Festival task desk</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Ticket total</span><strong>Exact prices and quantity available</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sample picture</span><strong>Prediction from labelled examples</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Volunteer message</span><strong>Draft checked against sources</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "is-ai-needed-here-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Three approaches",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Rules follow explicit instructions. A learned prediction uses patterns from examples. A generated response produces new content. Any approach still needs suitable inputs and checking. Sometimes a simple calculation or verified lookup is sufficient.",
              "dialogue": "A rule, a prediction and a draft are different.",
              "status": "Understanding the method",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 32.276,
              "duration": 16.832,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8V4H8\"></path><rect width=\"16\" height=\"12\" x=\"4\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M2 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 13v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Three approaches</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Rule: explicit steps for an exact task</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Prediction: patterns learned from examples</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Generation: a draft that needs checking</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "is-ai-needed-here-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose a tool",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The festival desk sells three tickets at twenty rupees each, with no discount. Which approach best fits the exact total? Choose the tool whose result can be traced to the stated rule.",
              "dialogue": "Do we need AI to multiply three by twenty?",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 49.758,
              "duration": 11.968,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8V4H8\"></path><rect width=\"16\" height=\"12\" x=\"4\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M2 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 13v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose a tool</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg><strong>Festival task desk</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Ticket total</span><strong>Exact prices and quantity available</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sample picture</span><strong>Prediction from labelled examples</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Volunteer message</span><strong>Draft checked against sources</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>Three tickets cost â‚¹20 each, with no discount. Which approach fits the exact total?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A generated guess</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The stated multiplication rule</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A model trained on other events</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "is-ai-needed-here-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "A proportionate choice",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The team uses a rule for the bill. It considers a small prediction experiment for object images and a checked draft for volunteer instructions. It keeps official policy answers tied to supplied sources instead of treating generated text as authority.",
              "dialogue": "Choose the smallest approach that serves the task.",
              "status": "Reviewing the evidence",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 62.376,
              "duration": 16.299,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 8V4H8\"></path><rect width=\"16\" height=\"12\" x=\"4\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M2 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 14h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 13v2\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A proportionate choice</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg><strong>Festival task desk</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Ticket total</span><strong>Explicit price Ã— quantity rule</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sample picture</span><strong>Prediction from labelled examples</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Volunteer message</span><strong>Draft checked against sources</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
