              "title": "A useful brief",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The team wants a helper for festival volunteers sorting clean practice samples. Before collecting examples, Asha asks who will use it, what decision it supports and how anyone will know whether it helps.",
              "dialogue": "Useful for whom, and for which decision?",
              "status": "Planning the experiment",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 12.715,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A useful brief</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/festival-planning.webp\" alt=\"Two students plan a school festival using a laptop, notebooks and project folders.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Start with the task, the people using it and a testable definition of success.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
