              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 13.365,
              "duration": 14.315,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The vague promise</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg><strong>Experiment brief</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>User</span><strong>Festival volunteers</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Input â†’ output</span><strong>Practice image â†’ material suggestion or review</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Success</span><strong>Fixed held-out pack, target defined first</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Unfamiliar case</span><strong>Needs an explicit route</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "frame-a-useful-ai-problem-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Make success observable",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Define the user, input and output. Set a measurable criterion using a fixed set of unseen examples, and specify the action for uncertainty. This is a low-stakes classroom prototype, not an autonomous system handling real waste.",
              "dialogue": "A clear limit belongs in the brief.",
              "status": "Understanding the method",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 28.329,
              "duration": 15.723,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Make success observable</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Define the user, input and output</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Specify success before looking at results</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Keep a human review route for unfamiliar cases</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "frame-a-useful-ai-problem-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Keep a human role",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The prototype receives a damaged or unfamiliar sample. Its training examples do not cover that condition. Should it force a label, or flag the sample for a person to review?",
              "dialogue": "Make the uncertain case part of the design.",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 44.702,
              "duration": 12.032,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Keep a human role</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg><strong>Experiment brief</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>User</span><strong>Festival volunteers</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Input â†’ output</span><strong>Practice image â†’ material suggestion or review</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Success</span><strong>Fixed held-out pack, target defined first</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Unfamiliar case</span><strong>Needs an explicit route</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>An unfamiliar sample is outside the training coverage. What should the prototype do?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Force a confident material label</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Identify the student who brought it</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Flag it for human review</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
