              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI evaluation record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this evidence for your teacherâ€™s individual review. The automatic checks assess structured decisions, not the quality of an oral defence.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ChoiceTask",
                  "choices": [
                    "Declare the bright-only collection representative of all conditions",
                    "Invent missing dim-condition examples",
                    "State the bright-only limitation and collect separate varied examples with a fresh evaluation pack"
