                  "answer": 2,
                  "feedback": "The collection does not establish dim-condition performance. Record that limitation and collect suitable new evidence instead of inventing rows or claiming broad coverage.",
                  "success": "Data card: tiny synthetic bright-only collection; label repairs are traceable, unknowns are quarantined and dim conditions remain unevaluated. Collect varied examples and a separate fresh test."
