              "prompt": "Change the training selection, then commit held-out predictions before revealing labels.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">Invented feature coordinates, not real material measurements. Start with paper-only training, observe predictions, then add both Metal examples. Distance = |xâ‚âˆ’xâ‚‚| + |yâ‚âˆ’yâ‚‚|. Equal-nearest labels that disagree request review.</p><div class=\"sampleGrid\"><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/><span><strong>P1 Â· Paper</strong><small>Features (1, 2)</small></span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked=\"\"/><span><strong>P2 Â· Paper</strong><small>Features (2, 1)</small></span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span><strong>M1 Â· Metal</strong><small>Features (8, 7)</small></span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span><strong>M2 Â· Metal</strong><small>Features (9, 8)</small></span></label></div><div class=\"tableWrap\"><table class=\"table\"><caption>Held-out examples Â· labels stay hidden until predictions are committed</caption><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Features</th><th>Prediction</th><th>Held-out label</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>T1</th><td>(3, 2)</td><td>Paper</td><td>Hidden</td></tr><tr><th>T2</th><td>(7, 8)</td><td>Paper</td><td>Hidden</td></tr><tr><th>T3</th><td>(4, 5)</td><td>Paper</td><td>Hidden</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"controls\"><button class=\"secondary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg>Commit predictions</button><button class=\"secondary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Reveal held-out labels</button><button class=\"secondary\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg>Reset experiment</button></div></div></div></div></section>",
