              "start": 0,
              "duration": 14.784,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/ai-source-desk.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The evaluation meeting</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/ai-source-desk.webp\" alt=\"Asha and Kabir compare a laptop assistant response with a printed memo, open reference book and source folder in the school library.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>The actual source passage determines which assistant claims the team can support.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "ai-evaluation-review-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Evidence is incomplete",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The model slightly beats the baseline on the tiny pack, but dim examples perform poorly. The current proposal would label every sample automatically. A narrow overall improvement does not justify removing human review or claiming broad reliability.",
              "dialogue": "Our limits belong in the recommendation.",
              "status": "Checking the problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.434,
              "duration": 16.448,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Evidence is incomplete</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg><strong>AI evaluation hearing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Baseline comparison</span><strong>Model 6/8 Â· baseline 5/8</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Known limitation</span><strong>Dim group: 5/8 errors</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Human route</span><strong>Missing from current proposal</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Changed setting</span><strong>Evening conditions not evaluated</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "ai-evaluation-review-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "A defensible dossier",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "An evaluation dossier states the intended use, data limits, comparator, test results, fairness concern and human intervention point. It records what should trigger revision or stopping, and discloses any AI help used in preparing the work.",
              "dialogue": "A go decision needs conditions, not just enthusiasm.",
              "status": "Understanding the method",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 32.532,
              "duration": 15.595,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A defensible dossier</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A dossier links purpose, data and results</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Overall improvement can hide uneven errors</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Changed conditions need fresh evidence</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "ai-evaluation-review-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Make the recommendation",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The small test shows weak dim-condition performance and there is no human fallback yet. Choose the recommendation that fits the evidence before the prototype is used more widely.",
              "dialogue": "What needs to change before anyone relies on it?",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 48.777,
              "duration": 11.285,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Make the recommendation</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg><strong>AI evaluation hearing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Baseline comparison</span><strong>Model 6/8 Â· baseline 5/8</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Known limitation</span><strong>Dim group: 5/8 errors</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Human route</span><strong>Missing from current proposal</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Changed setting</span><strong>Evening conditions not evaluated</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>Dim-condition performance is weak and no human fallback exists. What should happen before wider use?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Deploy automatically because the average improved</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Hide the dim-condition results</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Revise the data and review plan, then test again</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "ai-evaluation-review-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "An unseen condition",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The festival moves to an evening courtyard that was never evaluated. The team pauses automatic use, keeps a manual route and proposes a separate collection and fresh test. New conditions require new evidence, not a recycled score.",
              "dialogue": "Our earlier score does not cover this new setting.",
              "status": "Reviewing the evidence",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 60.712,
              "duration": 15.445,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">An unseen condition</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flask-conical\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 .245.96l5.51 10.08A2 2 0 0 1 18 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-1.755-2.96l5.51-10.08A2 2 0 0 0 10 8V2\"></path><path d=\"M6.453 15h11.094\"></path><path d=\"M8.5 2h7\"></path></svg><strong>AI evaluation hearing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Baseline comparison</span><strong>Model 6/8 Â· baseline 5/8</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Known limitation</span><strong>Dim group: 5/8 errors</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Human route</span><strong>Manual review retained</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Changed setting</span><strong>Evening conditions not evaluated</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "ai-evaluation-review-6",
              "label": "Enter the lab",
              "title": "Enter the lab",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Complete the dossier, defend a use or revise decision and handle the changed evening case. Record assistance honestly. Your teacher can ask for an individual explanation on fresh evidence, beyond the labâ€™s structured checks.",
              "dialogue": "Defend both the decision and its practical limits.",
              "status": "Ready to practise",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 76.807,
              "duration": 15.595,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 AI experiment</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Enter the lab</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A dossier links purpose, data and results</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Overall improvement can hide uneven errors</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Changed conditions need fresh evidence</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional examples and prepared outputs. No private records or external AI account required.</small></div>"
            }
          ],
          "practice": [
            {
              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "Decide use, revise or stop from a task brief, data limits, baseline, held-out results, group errors and human oversight. Disclose assistance; teacher review assesses your independent explanation.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival AI evaluation lab",
              "prompt": "Assemble the evaluation dossier from evidence.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Intended user, input, output and human review point</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Data-quality log and missing-condition limitations</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Baseline and model results on the same held-out pack</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Group-level errors, mitigation and stop-use condition</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Replace the results with the assistant&#x27;s confident recommendation</span></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Test protection</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI evaluation record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this evidence for your teacherâ€™s individual review. The automatic checks assess structured decisions, not the quality of an oral defence.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ControlChecklist",
                  "controls": [
                    {
                      "id": "purpose",
                      "label": "Intended user, input, output and human review point",
                      "good": true,
                      "why": "Evaluation needs a defined purpose and human authority."
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "data",
                      "label": "Data-quality log and missing-condition limitations",
                      "good": true,
                      "why": "A decision must acknowledge data quality and coverage."
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "results",
                      "label": "Baseline and model results on the same held-out pack",
                      "good": true,
                      "why": "The comparison must use the same examples and denominator."
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "groups",
                      "label": "Group-level errors, mitigation and stop-use condition",
                      "good": true,
                      "why": "The overall score does not explain uneven errors or changed conditions."
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "confidence",
                      "label": "Replace the results with the assistant's confident recommendation",
                      "good": false,
                      "why": "A recommendation cannot replace the evidence that should support it."
                    }
                  ],
                  "success": "Evaluation dossier: intended use and human role; quality log and coverage limits; model 6/8 versus baseline 5/8 on the same pack; Bright 1/8 errors versus Dim 5/8; mitigation and stop-use criteria."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stage": 1,
              "brief": "Decide use, revise or stop from a task brief, data limits, baseline, held-out results, group errors and human oversight. Disclose assistance; teacher review assesses your independent explanation.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival AI evaluation lab",
              "prompt": "Recommend what to do with this limited prototype.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">Evidence: model 6/8, baseline 5/8 on one tiny test; Bright errors 1/8, Dim errors 5/8; no human fallback in the current proposal. This is insufficient evidence for wider automatic use.</p><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"actionBank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Use automatically everywhere because 6 is greater than 5</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Revise coverage and human review, preserve the results and independently evaluate again</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Hide dim-condition errors in the overall average</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check decision</button></div></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI evaluation record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this evidence for your teacherâ€™s individual review. The automatic checks assess structured decisions, not the quality of an oral defence.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ChoiceTask",
                  "choices": [
                    "Use automatically everywhere because 6 is greater than 5",
                    "Revise coverage and human review, preserve the results and independently evaluate again",
                    "Hide dim-condition errors in the overall average"
                  ],
                  "answer": 1,
                  "feedback": "A small average improvement does not resolve the known coverage and human-review gaps. Revise and independently evaluate before wider use.",
                  "success": "Recommendation: revise before wider use. Improve coverage, add human review, preserve original results and evaluate changes on a fresh independent pack; retain a manual baseline meanwhile."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Decide use, revise or stop from a task brief, data limits, baseline, held-out results, group errors and human oversight. Disclose assistance; teacher review assesses your independent explanation.",
              "eyebrow": "Festival AI evaluation lab",
              "prompt": "The festival moves to an untested evening setting. Defend a revised decision.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">Unseen case: the festival moves to an evening courtyard. This condition was not evaluated. State a next action and disclose how you prepared your recommendation.</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Changed-condition decision</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option value=\"go\">Reuse the earlier score as proof for evening use</option><option value=\"pause\">Pause automatic use; use manual review and gather separate evening evidence</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>My assistance disclosure</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose what is true for your workâ€¦</option><option value=\"lab\">I used this prepared lab and no additional AI tool</option><option value=\"assisted\">I used additional AI assistance; I will identify it and explain what I verified to my teacher</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Defend evaluation decision</button><p class=\"micro\">Disclosure is self-reported. Your teacher reviews your independent explanation; selecting an option does not verify authorship.</p></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI evaluation record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this evidence for your teacherâ€™s individual review. The automatic checks assess structured decisions, not the quality of an oral defence.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            }
          ],
          "decisionTask": {
            "title": "The team defends its AI decision",
            "concepts": [
              "A dossier links purpose, data and results",
              "Overall improvement can hide uneven errors",
              "Changed conditions need fresh evidence"
            ],
            "question": "Dim-condition performance is weak and no human fallback exists. What should happen before wider use?",
            "choices": [
              "Deploy automatically because the average improved",
              "Hide the dim-condition results",
              "Revise the data and review plan, then test again"
            ],
            "answer": 2,
            "why": "Address the known failure and human review gap before wider use; preserve the original evidence and evaluate changes independently."
          }
        }
