              "text": "A policy question is absent from the source pack. Choose the next action."
            },
            {
              "line": 97,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Define user, input, output, measurable success and human review before collecting data. This is a low-stakes experiment using fictional samples."
            },
            {
              "line": 97,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Build a testable brief for the sample-sorting helper."
