            {
              "line": 97,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Turn a vague promise into an acceptance criterion."
            },
            {
              "line": 98,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Use supplied observations to justify corrections. Keep unknowns visible, distinguish duplicates from similar samples and record limitations."
