            {
              "line": 99,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Match learning tasks to their methods."
            },
            {
              "line": 99,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Change the training selection, then commit held-out predictions before revealing labels."
            },
            {
              "line": 99,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Protect an independent test when a new example arrives."
            },
            {
              "line": 100,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Compare the model and baseline on the same held-out examples. Count mistakes and keep any performance claim within the evidence."
            },
            {
              "line": 100,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Count correct model and majority-baseline predictions on this pack."
            },
            {
              "line": 100,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Identify the exact model mistakes."
            },
            {
              "line": 100,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Choose the performance claim supported by a small fixed test."
            },
            {
              "line": 101,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Inspect coverage and group-level errors. A proxy is a stand-in feature; an error difference alone does not prove a cause. Plan representative evaluation and human review."
            },
            {
              "line": 101,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Calculate errors in bright and dim conditions."
            },
            {
              "line": 101,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Inspect a controlled background change for a possible proxy."
            },
            {
              "line": 101,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Choose a collection and fallback plan for missing conditions."
            },
            {
              "line": 102,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Check the actual source passage, not citation-shaped text. Distinguish supported, contradicted and unestablished claims. The source pack is fictional."
            },
            {
              "line": 102,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Audit the assistant's claims against the fixed source pack."
            },
            {
              "line": 102,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Improve the task instruction without adding personal records."
            },
            {
              "line": 102,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Build a corrected response with matching source references."
            },
            {
              "line": 103,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Decide use, revise or stop from a task brief, data limits, baseline, held-out results, group errors and human oversight. Disclose assistance; teacher review assesses your independent explanation."
