              "caption": "Asha and Kabir help organise a fictional scholarship enquiry desk. Requests arrive as anonymous practice records. The team needs a clear process before building a screen or writing code. Real award decisions remain with the responsible teacher.",
              "dialogue": "What are the separate jobs inside this request?",
              "status": "Planning the workflow",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 16.192,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/ct-scholarship-desk.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"15\"></line><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A busy enquiry desk</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/ct-scholarship-desk.webp\" alt=\"Asha sorts anonymous enquiry cards into trays while Kabir checks a laptop record table, with a teacher available in the school library.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>The team separates intake, rule checking, teacher review and communication before automating the workflow.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
