            {
              "id": "model-only-what-matters-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Names are not reliable keys",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "Two separate applicants can have the same name, and one ID may appear twice. Overwriting a keyed record would hide that conflict. The model needs a stable identifier and a route for duplicate or missing data.",
              "dialogue": "A tidy table must not erase a conflict.",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.327,
              "duration": 13.568,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-git-branch\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"15\"></line><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle><path d=\"M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Names are not reliable keys</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg><strong>Minimal data dictionary</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>ID</span><strong>Uppercase letter + two digits Â· unique</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Score</span><strong>Finite 0â€“100 or explicitly missing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Documents</span><strong>Complete / incomplete / unknown</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Duplicate ID</span><strong>Conflict needs a defined route</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
