              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>The written comparison uses =&gt; where this pseudocode requires &gt;=</span><select aria-label=\"The written comparison uses =&gt; where this pseudocode requires &gt;=\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Syntax-like error</option><option>Logic error</option><option>Test evidence</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>The code runs but uses score &gt; 60 for an at-least-60 rule</span><select aria-label=\"The code runs but uses score &gt; 60 for an at-least-60 rule\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Syntax-like error</option><option>Logic error</option><option>Test evidence</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>A failing boundary example is rerun after the correction</span><select aria-label=\"A failing boundary example is rerun after the correction\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Syntax-like error</option><option>Logic error</option><option>Test evidence</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
