          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "search-and-sort-with-purpose-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "Find one enquiry",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha needs applicant ID sixty in a shuffled list of seven numeric practice IDs. Linear search can inspect them in order without sorting first. The team will count comparisons instead of declaring one method best for every task.",
              "dialogue": "How much work does this lookup actually take?",
              "status": "Planning the workflow",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 15.509,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/ct-logic-workbench.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Find one enquiry</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/ct-logic-workbench.webp\" alt=\"Asha arranges branching flowchart tiles while Kabir points to a highlighted trace-table row on a laptop at a school logic workbench.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A small test case can expose a wrong branch; the corrected workflow must be traced and tested again.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "search-and-sort-with-purpose-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "A fast-looking mistake",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "A teammate proposes binary search on the shuffled list. Binary search discards part of the search range based on ordering, so that shortcut is not valid until the data satisfies the sorted-order requirement.",
              "dialogue": "The method has a precondition.",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.159,
              "duration": 13.525,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A fast-looking mistake</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg><strong>Measured lookup for ID 60</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Shuffled list</span><strong>40, 10, 70, 20, 60, 30, 50</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Linear lookup</span><strong>5 comparisons</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sorted binary lookup</span><strong>2 comparisons</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Important limit</span><strong>Sorting preparation cost excluded</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "search-and-sort-with-purpose-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Compare with purpose",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Linear search checks items one by one. Binary search checks a middle item in sorted data and narrows the range. Sorting itself takes work. A tiny one-off enquiry and many repeated lookups can justify different choices.",
              "dialogue": "Count the work and state what you excluded.",
              "status": "Tracing the reasoning",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 30.335,
              "duration": 15.552,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Compare with purpose</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Linear search works on the shuffled list</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Binary search requires sorted order</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Lookup comparisons exclude sorting preparation</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "search-and-sort-with-purpose-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Protect the precondition",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The numeric IDs are still shuffled. Which action is justified before using binary search? Choose between using linear search directly and establishing the required sorted order before a binary-search experiment.",
              "dialogue": "Do not discard half a range without an ordering guarantee.",
              "status": "Your turn",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 46.537,
              "duration": 14.059,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Protect the precondition</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg><strong>Measured lookup for ID 60</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Shuffled list</span><strong>40, 10, 70, 20, 60, 30, 50</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Linear lookup</span><strong>5 comparisons</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sorted binary lookup</span><strong>2 comparisons</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Important limit</span><strong>Sorting preparation cost excluded</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>The IDs are shuffled. What is a valid next step?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Discard half the unsorted list</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Assume it is sorted because the IDs are numbers</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Use linear search, or establish sorted order before binary search</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">