              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">Target numeric practice ID: 60. Binary search requires ascending order. These lookup comparison counts exclude sorting cost.</p><div class=\"numberStrip\" aria-label=\"Search data\"><span data-checked=\"false\"><small>Index 0</small><b>40</b><em>Unseen</em></span><span data-checked=\"false\"><small>Index 1</small><b>10</b><em>Unseen</em></span><span data-checked=\"false\"><small>Index 2</small><b>70</b><em>Unseen</em></span><span data-checked=\"false\"><small>Index 3</small><b>20</b><em>Unseen</em></span><span data-checked=\"false\"><small>Index 4</small><b>60</b><em>Unseen</em></span><span data-checked=\"false\"><small>Index 5</small><b>30</b><em>Unseen</em></span><span data-checked=\"false\"><small>Index 6</small><b>50</b><em>Unseen</em></span></div><div class=\"controls\"><button class=\"secondary\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg>Sort IDs ascending</button><button class=\"secondary\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg>Next binary comparison</button></div><output class=\"callout\" aria-live=\"polite\">Comparisons shown: 0 Â· Continue the trace</output><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Total lookup comparisons</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" value=\"\"/></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Save search comparison</button></div></div></div></section>",
