              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><pre class=\"code\">checkApplicant(record)\n  one shared validated rule: score â‰¥ 60 AND documents</pre><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>B20 Â· 60 Â· complete</span><select aria-label=\"Predict B20\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Predict resultâ€¦</option><option>Eligible</option><option>Not eligible</option><option>Needs documents</option><option>Review missing data</option><option>Invalid record</option><option>Duplicate ID</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>C30 Â· 59 Â· complete</span><select aria-label=\"Predict C30\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Predict resultâ€¦</option><option>Eligible</option><option>Not eligible</option><option>Needs documents</option><option>Review missing data</option><option>Invalid record</option><option>Duplicate ID</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>D40 Â· 65 Â· incomplete</span><select aria-label=\"Predict D40\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Predict resultâ€¦</option><option>Eligible</option><option>Not eligible</option><option>Needs documents</option><option>Review missing data</option><option>Invalid record</option><option>Duplicate ID</option></select></label><button class=\"secondary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg>Run the shared function</button><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></pat