              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "A green demonstration is not enough",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha has seen one valid record pass. That is useful, but it does not show what happens at the exact threshold, with an empty list, with duplicate IDs or with missing fields. She starts a test matrix before calling the workflow reliable.",
              "dialogue": "Which cases could still break it?",
              "status": "Planning the workflow",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 15.488,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/ct-logic-workbench.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list-checks\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 17 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 7 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M13 6h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 12h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 18h8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A green demonstration is not enough</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/ct-logic-workbench.webp\" alt=\"Asha arranges branching flowchart tiles while Kabir points to a highlighted trace-table row on a laptop at a school logic workbench.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A small test case can expose a wrong branch; the corrected workflow must be traced and tested again.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "test-the-boundaries-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "The hidden boundary",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "A draft uses greater than sixty. An ordinary score of seventy-two passes, so the mistake is easy to miss. The exact-threshold case of sixty exposes it immediately. Other cases are needed for input and collection behaviour.",
              "dialogue": "A carefully chosen case can reveal a hidden error.",
              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.138,
              "duration": 15.68,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list-checks\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 17 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 7 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M13 6h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 12h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 18h8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The hidden boundary</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg><strong>Six-case test matrix</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T1</span><strong>Ordinary: A10, score 72, complete â†’ Eligible</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T2</span><strong>Boundary: B20, score exactly 60, complete â†’ Eligible</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T3</span><strong>Just below: C30, score 59, complete â†’ Not eligible</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T4</span><strong>Empty applicant list â†’ Empty list handled</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T5</span><strong>Duplicate A10 records with conflicting scores â†’ Duplicate IDs flagged</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T6</span><strong>Missing score: E50, documents complete â†’ Review missing data</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "test-the-boundaries-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Build a test matrix",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Include ordinary, boundary and invalid cases with expected results. Check an empty collection without a crash, flag duplicate IDs without overwriting and preserve missing data for review. A passing finite set supports confidence but cannot prove correctness for every possible input.",
              "dialogue": "Write the expected outcome before running the test.",
              "status": "Tracing the reasoning",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 32.468,
              "duration": 18.112,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list-checks\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 17 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 7 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M13 6h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 12h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 18h8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Build a test matrix</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Write expected results before running tests</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Include boundary, empty, duplicate and missing cases</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Finite tests support confidence without proving all inputs</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
            },
