              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list-checks\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 17 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 7 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M13 6h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 12h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 18h8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose a revealing case</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg><strong>Six-case test matrix</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T1</span><strong>Ordinary: A10, score 72, complete â†’ Eligible</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T2</span><strong>Boundary: B20, score exactly 60, complete â†’ Eligible</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T3</span><strong>Just below: C30, score 59, complete â†’ Not eligible</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T4</span><strong>Empty applicant list â†’ Empty list handled</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T5</span><strong>Duplicate A10 records with conflicting scores â†’ Duplicate IDs flagged</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>T6</span><strong>Missing score: E50, documents complete â†’ Review missing data</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>Which score best reveals the difference between &gt; 60 and â‰¥ 60?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">72</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Exactly 60</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">95</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
