              "status": "Investigating a problem",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.714,
              "duration": 16.512,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-list-checks\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m3 17 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m3 7 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M13 6h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 12h8\"></path><path d=\"M13 18h8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 workflow desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The requirement changes</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg><strong>Revised â‰¥70 exercise brief</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Score 60 / complete</span><strong>Not eligible under the new rule</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Exactly 70 / complete</span><strong>Eligible</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Missing or duplicate data</span><strong>Review protections retained</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Real award decision</span><strong>Still with the responsible teacher</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records and criteria. The simulation makes no real awards or payments.</small></div>"
