            {
              "line": 132,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Break the fictional enquiry into inputs, checks, teacher review and communication. Separate facts, assumptions and constraints. The exercise never awards real scholarships."
            },
            {
              "line": 132,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Build the enquiry process from four connected steps."
            },
            {
              "line": 132,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Separate supplied facts from assumptions and scope constraints."
            },
            {
              "line": 132,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Define what belongs inside the workflow and what stays with a person."
            },
            {
              "line": 133,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Use a minimal synthetic record: stable ID, score and document status. A record, list and keyed lookup serve different jobs. Preserve duplicates and missing values for review."
            },
            {
              "line": 133,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Choose only the fields needed for this fictional model."
