            {
              "line": 133,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Apply the data dictionary to conflicting, invalid and missing inputs."
            },
            {
              "line": 134,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Exercise rule: score â‰¥ 60 AND complete documents, after input validation. Missing data and incomplete documents need explicit paths. These are invented criteria, not real award rules."
            },
            {
              "line": 134,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Complete the decision table before writing pseudocode."
            },
            {
              "line": 134,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Build and run the Boolean rule against boundary and document cases."
            },
            {
              "line": 134,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Order the pseudocode so validation and missing-data handling are preserved."
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Trace indexes, values and results. Zero-based indexes stop before length. Valid-looking code can still express the wrong rule; retain a failing case and rerun after repair."
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Run the loop, inspect the extra iteration and repair its guard."
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Repair the exact-threshold comparison and rerun the evidence."
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Distinguish syntax-like mistakes, logical mistakes and test evidence."
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Linear search can inspect unsorted data. Binary search needs sorted order. Count comparisons for this pack and remember that sorting preparation also costs work."
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Step through linear search for numeric practice ID 60."
