            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Choose methods for a new enquiry situation and explain preparation cost."
            },
            {
              "line": 137,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Define a reusable function by its input, output and validation. One shared check keeps callers consistent; a missing value must not silently become zero or false."
            },
            {
              "line": 137,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Specify the contract for the shared applicant check."
