            {
              "line": 137,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Remove a score field and inspect the defined review route."
            },
            {
              "line": 138,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Specify expected outcomes before testing ordinary, boundary, empty, duplicate and missing-data cases. Passing a finite matrix is evidence, not proof for every possible input."
            },
            {
              "line": 138,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Build the minimum six-case test matrix."
