            {
              "line": 147,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Assume it is sorted because the IDs are numbers"
            },
            {
              "line": 147,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Use linear search, or establish sorted order before binary search"
            },
            {
              "line": 147,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Binary search relies on ordering. Use a method whose precondition holds, or prepare and verify the sorted order first."
            },
            {
              "line": 148,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Kabir reuses one reliable check"
