              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Revision evidence: shared threshold updated to â‰¥70; score 60 is now Not eligible, exactly 70 is Eligible, 69 is Not eligible; empty, duplicate and missing-data protections still pass. Expected changes follow the new brief."
