              "text": "Complete"
            },
            {
              "line": 141,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Pick 72 because it gives the desired outcome and delete the other record"
            },
            {
              "line": 141,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Award a real scholarship from the higher score"
            },
            {
              "line": 141,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Preserve both records, flag the duplicate, seek authorised review and add this conflict to the tests"
            },
            {
              "line": 141,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The duplicate identity conflict is unresolved. A high score cannot justify overwriting evidence, choosing a convenient row or making a real award."
            },
            {
              "line": 141,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Unseen defence: preserve the conflicting B20 records, flag the duplicate and refer it for authorised review. Add the conflict to regression evidence; a correct threshold alone cannot resolve identity ambiguity."
