              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "An extraordinary internship",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir receives a fictional internship offer with an unusually high stipend. The sender requests an upfront processing payment and an identity-document upload. The school has supplied a separate official-source pack for comparison.",
              "dialogue": "What does the supplied organisation actually say?",
              "status": "Inspect the case",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 14.741,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/fraud-offer-desk.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 verification desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">An extraordinary internship</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/fraud-offer-desk.webp\" alt=\"Asha pauses before handing over an identity envelope while Kabir compares an internship offer with an independent source and a teacher helps nearby.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Compare the exact offer with an independent source before sharing documents or money.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional cases only. No real payments, calls, document uploads or reports.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-internship-that-pays-too-well-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Compare the sources",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The offer uses the organisation name but comes from a different address. The supplied official pack lists a different application channel, no processing fee and no identity upload at this stage. These contradictions matter more than the polished layout.",
              "dialogue": "A real organisation name does not verify this sender.",
              "status": "Evidence unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.391,
              "duration": 15.68,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 verification desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Compare the sources</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Internship source comparison Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Offer Â· sender</span><strong>Bright Path Internships &lt;recruit@brightpath-offers.example&gt;</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Offer Â· demand</span><strong>Pay â‚¹1,500 today; upload a full ID scan to reserve the role</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Independent source pack</span><strong>Bright Path Learning Â· brightpath.example Â· applications only through its listed portal</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Official process in this exercise</span><strong>No processing fee; no identity-document upload at this stage</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional cases only. No real payments, calls, document uploads or reports.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-internship-that-pays-too-well-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Build due diligence",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Compare the role, process, contact route and payment request with independently obtained information. Keep personal documents private while the offer is unresolved. A confident promise is not evidence that a particular recruiter is authorised.",
              "dialogue": "Check the exact offer, not only whether the organisation exists.",
              "status": "Build a check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 31.721,
              "duration": 15.701,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 verification desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Build due diligence</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Verify the exact offer and recruiter</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Compare fee and document stage with the source pack</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Keep identity documents private while unresolved</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional cases only. No real payments, calls, document uploads or reports.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-internship-that-pays-too-well-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose a supported response",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The supplied official pack contradicts the payment and document instructions. Should Kabir pay to hold the place, send a smaller identity scan, or reject these instructions and verify through the listed official application route?",
              "dialogue": "Tie the decision to the contradiction.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 48.073,
              "duration": 14.165,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 verification desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose a supported response</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Internship source comparison Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Offer Â· sender</span><strong>Bright Path Internships &lt;recruit@brightpath-offers.example&gt;</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Offer Â· demand</span><strong>Pay â‚¹1,500 today; upload a full ID scan to reserve the role</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Independent source pack</span><strong>Bright Path Learning Â· brightpath.example Â· applications only through its listed portal</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Official process in this exercise</span><strong>No processing fee; no identity-document upload at this stage</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>The independent pack says no fee or ID upload at this stage. What should Kabir do?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pay to reserve the role</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Send half an ID scan first</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Reject these instructions and check through the official application route</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional cases only. No real payments, calls, document uploads or reports.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-internship-that-pays-too-well-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "The offer stays unverified",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir preserves the offer, rejects the unsupported payment and document requests, and checks using the independent route. He can explain what contradicted the offer without claiming that every attractive opportunity is fraudulent.",
              "dialogue": "A pause or rejection needs a reason.",
              "status": "Evidence updated",
              "tone": "resolved",
