              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "A familiar voice",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha receives a fictional call that sounds like a relative. The caller says there is an emergency and demands an immediate private transfer. A familiar voice feels convincing, but it does not independently verify identity or the payment request.",
              "dialogue": "Can we check without following the callerâ€™s instructions?",
              "status": "Inspect the case",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 16,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/fraud-payment-pause.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 verification desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A familiar voice</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-11/fraud-payment-pause.webp\" alt=\"Asha keeps her thumb away from the phone controls while Kabir and a supportive adult help compare the payment screen with a festival receipt.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Pause, read who pays whom and check through a known route. The illustration is not a transaction record.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional cases only. No real payments, calls, document uploads or reports.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "a-familiar-voice-asks-for-money-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Pressure on the call",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The caller insists that Asha must not tell anyone and gives a new number to confirm the story. The same person would then control both the claim and its supposed verification. An intimidating authority claim can use the same pattern.",
              "dialogue": "A second number from the caller is not independent.",
              "status": "Evidence unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.65,
              "duration": 15.253,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 verification desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Pressure on the call</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Simulated incoming call Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sound</span><strong>Familiar relativeâ€™s voice</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Demand</span><strong>Secret emergency transfer</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Proposed verifier</span><strong>New number supplied by the same caller</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Status</span><strong>Identity and circumstances unverified</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional cases only. No real payments, calls, document uploads or reports.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "a-familiar-voice-asks-for-money-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Use known channels",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Calmly end the call. Contact the relative through a previously known route and involve a trusted adult. A second independent person or channel can help resolve the claim. Do not pay while identity and circumstances remain uncertain.",
              "dialogue": "Verification can be calm and supportive.",
              "status": "Build a check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 32.553,
              "duration": 15.36,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 11 verification desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Use known channels</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Familiar sound is insufficient identity evidence</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>End the call and use a previously known contact</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>An unanswered check leaves the claim unverified</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional cases only. No real payments, calls, document uploads or reports.</small></div>"
            },
