elected=\"\">Choose from supplied evidenceâ€¦</option><option>Guaranteed recovery after a processing fee</option><option>Outgoing payment approved after an unverified refund message</option></select></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Retain the relevant receipt/message; redact unrelated personal details from this classroom copy; include no PIN or OTP</span></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>Build mock report</button><p class=\"micro\">No report is submitted. In a real incident, preserve originals and use trusted official channels; classroom redaction must not destroy original evidence.</p></div></div></div></section>",
