              "prompt": "Set the next three actions and label the portfolio sources.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><fieldset class=\"portfolio\"><legend>Annual evidence portfolio</legend><p>Reuse your four earlier records, or honestly label the supplied replacement examples. Source labels and notes are saved with this chapter for teacher review.</p><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/your-digital-risk-map?grade=11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open security control chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Public evidence link â†’ named access and redaction</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Security control source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied classroom replacement</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/can-this-assistant-be-trusted?grade=11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open ai source/evaluation check chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Uncited â€œapproveâ€ advice â†’ compare with payment record</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>AI source/evaluation check source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied classroom replacement</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/test-the-boundaries?grade=11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open algorithm trace or test chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Verification missing â†’ pause/review; test the unknown case</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Algorithm trace or test source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied classroom replacement</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/before-you-approve-that-payment?grade=11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open payment-verification record chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: PAY â‚¹800 TO Refund Desk â†’ outgoing, cancel and verify</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Payment-verification record source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied classroom replacement</option></select></label></div><label class=\"noteLabel\">Portfolio notes / reflection for teacher review<textarea maxLength=\"300\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Use only fictional case details. Explain evidence, an alternative and what still needs checking.\"></textarea></label><small>Keep the reflection within 300 characters. Your teacher reviews its meaning and authorship; text length is not automatically scored.</small></fieldset><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Next action 1</span><select aria-label=\"Next action 1\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Cancel the outgoing approval; keep PIN and OTP private</option><option>Check the refund through the previously known school contact</option><option>Preserve restricted evidence; if a loss occurred, promptly contact bank and official reporting</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Next action 2</span><select aria-label=\"Next action 2\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Cancel the outgoing approval; keep PIN and OTP private</option><option>Check the refund through the previously known school contact</option><option>Preserve restricted evidence; if a loss occurred, promptly contact bank and official reporting</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Next action 3</span><select aria-label=\"Next action 3\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Cancel the outgoing approval; keep PIN and OTP private</option>