              "brief": "Annual capstone, lesson 2 of 2. Fresh classroom case: exam-fee correction, â‚¹950 private transfer, familiar voice and uncited assistant advice; independent notice does not confirm a correction. Prepare a two-minute individual defence for teacher review.",
