              "prompt": "Prepare your evidence, alternative, uncertainty and reflection.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><fieldset class=\"portfolio\"><legend>Annual evidence portfolio</legend><p>Reuse your four earlier records, or honestly label the supplied replacement examples. Source labels and notes are saved with this chapter for teacher review.</p><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/your-digital-risk-map?grade=11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open security control chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Public evidence link â†’ named access and redaction</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Security control source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied classroom replacement</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/can-this-assistant-be-trusted?grade=11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open ai source/evaluation check chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Uncited â€œapproveâ€ advice â†’ compare with payment record</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>AI source/evaluation check source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied classroom replacement</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/test-the-boundaries?grade=11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open algorithm trace or test chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Verification missing â†’ pause/review; test the unknown case</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Algorithm trace or test source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied classroom replacement</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/before-you-approve-that-payment?grade=11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open payment-verification record chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: PAY â‚¹800 TO Refund Desk â†’ outgoing, cancel and verify</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Payment-verification record source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied classroom replacement</option></select></label></div><label class=\"noteLabel\">Portfolio notes / reflection for teacher review<textarea maxLength=\"300\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Use only fictional case details. Explain evidence, an alternative and what still needs checking.\"></textarea></label><small>Keep the reflection within 300 characters. Your teacher reviews its meaning and authorship; text length is not automatically scored.</small></fieldset><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Decision to defend</span><select aria-label=\"Decision to defend\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Pause the transfer and verify independently</option><option>Small test payment fails to verify identity or authority</option><option>Whether any genuine fee correction exists and who is authorised</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Alternative and why it fails</span><select aria-label=\"Alternative and why it fails\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Pause the transfer and verify independently</option><option>Small test payment fails to verify identity or authority</option><option>Whether any genuine fee correction exists and who is authorised</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Remaining uncertainty</span><select aria-label=\"Remaining uncertainty\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Pause the transfer and verify independently</option><option>Small test payment fails to verify identity or authority</option><option>Whether any genuine fee correction exists and who is authorised</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div><div class=\"callout\"><strong>Two-minute individual defence</strong><p>Explain your decision and evidence; compare one alternative; state uncertainty and the next check; describe one revision from feedback. Show your four labelled portfolio items. Your teacher reviews understanding, ownership and reflection separately.</p></div></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your verification evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Structured decisions are checked automatically. Your teacher reviews the actual portfolio, individual defence and reflection. All case records are fictional.</p></div>",
