              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "For real Indian financial cyber fraud, immediately contact bank/payment provider using a trusted channel and promptly report via 1930 or cybercrime.gov.in, with trusted-adult support. Do not delay contact to collect a perfect file. This exercise never submits a report."
