              "line": 86,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Label all four portfolio sources honestly before saving the next actions. You can use the supplied replacements."
            },
            {
              "line": 86,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Next three actions: cancel outgoing approval and protect PIN/OTP; verify refund through known school contact; preserve restricted evidence and promptly contact bank/official reporting if a loss occurred. Portfolio source labels are recorded for teacher review."
            },
            {
              "line": 89,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Fresh-case analysis: private â‚¹950 correction is an unverified claim; the school pack does not establish it; familiar sound and AI confidence do not supply independent authority. Pause and use the previously known school contact."
            },
            {
              "line": 90,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Reject the assistantâ€™s test-payment advice; independently verify and explain why confidence is insufficient"
            },
            {
              "line": 90,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Send â‚¹1 first because the assistant sounds confident"
            },
            {
              "line": 90,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Share an OTP so the caller can prove their identity"
            },
            {
              "line": 90,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "A small payment still risks money and proves no authority; sharing an OTP increases exposure. Revise to independent verification and explain the contradictory or missing evidence."
            },
            {
              "line": 90,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Safer revision: reject test-payment and OTP-sharing advice; pause and use the known school route. The assistant supplies no independent evidence, and a familiar voice does not resolve the claim. Keep the first attempt as learning evidence."
            },
            {
              "line": 92,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Decision to defend"
            },
            {
              "line": 92,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Pause the transfer and verify independently"
            },
            {
              "line": 92,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The claim remains unverified by the supplied independent evidence."
            },
            {
              "line": 93,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Alternative and why it fails"
            },
            {
              "line": 93,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Small test payment fails to verify identity or authority"
            },
            {
              "line": 93,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "A payment does not establish the recipientâ€™s authority."
            },
            {
              "line": 94,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Remaining uncertainty"
            },
            {
              "line": 94,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Whether any genuine fee correction exists and who is authorised"
            },
            {
              "line": 94,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Keep unresolved facts explicit until the known school route confirms them."
            },
            {
              "line": 96,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "earlier"
            },
            {
              "line": 96,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "supplied"
            },
            {
              "line": 96,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Label all four portfolio sources before saving. Your teacher will review the actual earlier work or the labelled supplied examples."
            },
            {
              "line": 96,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Defence outline: pause private transfer; verify through the known school route; reject test payments because they prove no authority; state that the existence and authorisation of a fee correction remain uncertain. Four portfolio sources and reflection are saved for teacher review, not automatically judged as an oral pass."
            },
            {
              "line": 96,
              "kind": "On-screen text",
              "text": "Two-minute individual defence"
            },
            {
              "line": 96,
              "kind": "On-screen text",
              "text": "Explain your decision and evidence; compare one alternative; state uncertainty and the next check; describe one revision from feedback. Show your four labelled portfolio items. Your teacher reviews understanding, ownership and reflection separately."
            },
