          "practice": [
            {
              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "Fictional portal: participants see their own registration, organisers manage entries, suppliers publish the programme. Map actors and trust boundaries; use the supplied risk estimates and name an owner.",
              "eyebrow": "Portal design and incident lab",
              "prompt": "Complete the Class 11 entry check.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab illustratedActivity\"><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/portal-design-room.webp\" alt=\"Asha and Kabir arrange client, server and database concept tiles at a school makerspace table while a teacher helps discuss a trust boundary.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/><figcaption>Different actors cross different trust boundaries. Place each safeguard where its rule is enforced.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>A session verifies Ashaâ€™s identity</span><select aria-label=\"A session verifies Ashaâ€™s identity\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Authentication</option><option>Authorisation</option><option>Confidentiality impact</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>The server checks whether Asha may read record R20</span><select aria-label=\"The server checks whether Asha may read record R20\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Authentication</option><option>Authorisation</option><option>Confidentiality impact</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>A public export reveals registration contacts</span><select aria-label=\"A public export reveals registration contacts\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Authentication</option><option>Authorisation</option><option>Confidentiality impact</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your system assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked evidence alongside the earlier portal, timeline and recovery chapter records for your individual explanation. Your teacher reviews the viva separately. All tests use fictional offline models.</p></div>",
