ption>Risk owner and review point</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Browser sends a request into the application server</span><select aria-label=\"Browser sends a request into the application server\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Asset</option><option>Actors with different permitted tasks</option><option>Trust boundary</option><option>Risk owner and review point</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Named registration lead reviews access weekly</span><select aria-label=\"Named registration lead reviews access weekly\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Asset</option><option>Actors with different permitted tasks</option><option>Trust boundary</option><option>Risk owner and review point</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></div></section>",
