              "status": "Inspect the system",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 15.851,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/portal-design-room.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Design the college-fest portal</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/portal-design-room.webp\" alt=\"Asha and Kabir arrange client, server and database concept tiles at a school makerspace table while a teacher helps discuss a trust boundary.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Different actors cross different trust boundaries. Place each safeguard where its rule is enforced.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "design-the-college-fest-portal-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "The browser can change",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "A browser-side button hides private records in the first draft, but requests still reach the server. The design must not trust the client to report its own role or enforce the final access rule. A public browser should not hold database credentials.",
              "dialogue": "Place a check where the request cannot bypass it.",
              "status": "Risk unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.501,
              "duration": 16.107,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The browser can change</h2><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption>Fictional college-fest portal Â· trust changes at each arrow</figcaption><ol><li><div><strong>Browser</strong><span>Untrusted client input; display responses</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><div><strong>Application server</strong><span>Trusted session + action permission + validation</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><div><strong>Database</strong><span>Constrained service access; private records</span></div></li></ol><p>DNS locates the hostname; HTTPS protects the connection. External payment status crosses a separate server/provider verification boundary.</p></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
