              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 51.145,
              "duration": 13.568,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the control location</h2><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption>Fictional college-fest portal Â· trust changes at each arrow</figcaption><ol><li><div><strong>Browser</strong><span>Untrusted client input; display responses</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><div><strong>Application server</strong><span>Trusted session + action permission + validation</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><div><strong>Database</strong><span>Constrained service access; private records</span></div></li></ol><p>DNS locates the hostname; HTTPS protects the connection. External payment status crosses a separate server/provider verification boundary.</p></figure><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>Where should permission to read a private registration be enforced?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">On the server using trusted session and record data</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Only by hiding a browser button</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">In a shared password sent to everyone</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
