              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "A defensible architecture",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The team puts identity, permission and data access controls at their owning boundaries. HTTPS still protects transport; it does not certify the operator, prove a payment or grant database access. The external provider remains a dependency to assess.",
