              "status": "Inspect the system",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 15.275,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/portal-design-room.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A request that should fail</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/portal-design-room.webp\" alt=\"Asha and Kabir arrange client, server and database concept tiles at a school makerspace table while a teacher helps discuss a trust boundary.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Different actors cross different trust boundaries. Place each safeguard where its rule is enforced.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "secure-by-design-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Three different protections",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "Input validation checks the allowed shape or range. Authorisation checks whether this identified actor may perform this action on this record. Safe data access keeps supplied values from becoming query instructions. One control does not replace the other two.",
              "dialogue": "A valid input can still request an unauthorised record.",
              "status": "Risk unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.925,
              "duration": 17.131,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Three different protections</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Offline request test pack Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Own record Â· Asha / R10 / â‚¹100</span><strong>Draft controls disabled; compare Expected with Actual</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Different owner Â· Asha / R20 / â‚¹100</span><strong>Draft controls disabled; compare Expected with Actual</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Negative amount Â· Asha / R10 / âˆ’â‚¹1</span><strong>Draft controls disabled; compare Expected with Actual</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Unexpected identifier text Â· Asha / no matching record</span><strong>Draft controls disabled; compare Expected with Actual</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "secure-by-design-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Retain failing examples",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Keep an own-record case, a different-owner case, an invalid amount and an unexpected identifier. Run the draft, repair the specific controls and rerun the same cases. This toy model reports outcomes without executing any database query.",
              "dialogue": "Before-and-after evidence explains the correction.",
              "status": "Build the control",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 33.705,
              "duration": 16.299,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Retain failing examples</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Validate the input range</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Authorise the actorâ€™s action on this record</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Keep query values as data; retest the failing pack</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "secure-by-design-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Repair the boundary",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "A record identifier is well formed, but belongs to another participant. Does formatting make the request authorised? Choose the control that checks the actorâ€™s permitted action on the requested record.",
              "dialogue": "Identity, validity and permission are separate facts.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 50.654,
              "duration": 12.885,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Repair the boundary</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Offline request test pack Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Own record Â· Asha / R10 / â‚¹100</span><strong>Draft controls disabled; compare Expected with Actual</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Different owner Â· Asha / R20 / â‚¹100</span><strong>Draft controls disabled; compare Expected with Actual</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Negative amount Â· Asha / R10 / âˆ’â‚¹1</span><strong>Draft controls disabled; compare Expected with Actual</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Unexpected identifier text Â· Asha / no matching record</span><strong>Draft controls disabled; compare Expected with Actual</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>A valid-looking ID belongs to another participant. Which control is required?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Only amount formatting</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Per-record server authorisation</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">An HTTPS icon alone</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
