            {
              "id": "protect-the-whole-dependency-chain-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "The portal depends on others",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir evaluates a fictional event-service supplier and a payment integration. The supplier can publish a programme without downloading registrations. The team also depends on updates, private secrets and a recovery route that must work during an outage.",
              "dialogue": "Which dependency can affect the whole service?",
              "status": "Inspect the system",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 15.637,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/portal-design-room.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The portal depends on others</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/portal-design-room.webp\" alt=\"Asha and Kabir arrange client, server and database concept tiles at a school makerspace table while a teacher helps discuss a trust boundary.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Different actors cross different trust boundaries. Place each safeguard where its rule is enforced.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-whole-dependency-chain-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "A constrained budget",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The exercise gives the team six budget units. Three targeted controls cost two units each: least-privilege supplier access, private managed secrets with rotation, and independent tested recovery. Decorative assurance badges cannot replace these requirements.",
              "dialogue": "Use the stated needs to defend the spend.",
              "status": "Risk unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.287,
              "duration": 17.365,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A constrained budget</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Supplier dependency brief Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Budget</span><strong>6 invented units</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Supplier task</span><strong>Publish programme; no registration export</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Required controls</span><strong>Programme-only expiry; managed secrets/updates; independent recovery</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Cost</span><strong>2 units per required control</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-whole-dependency-chain-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Minimum access and exit",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Limit purpose, scope, duration and onward sharing. Name the owner who revokes access when work ends. Keep a trusted update route and avoid putting integration secrets in the client or a group chat. Test recovery independently of the failed supplier.",
              "dialogue": "A supplier agreement needs an exit as well as an entry.",
              "status": "Build the control",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 34.303,
              "duration": 16.661,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Minimum access and exit</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Programme task â†’ programme-only access</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Private managed secrets and trusted updates</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Independent recovery with a named owner and exit</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-whole-dependency-chain-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose the supplier access",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The supplier needs to publish the programme. Should it receive the full registration export, a shared organiser account, or only programme-publishing access that expires after the task?",
              "dialogue": "Useful access can remain narrow.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 51.614,
              "duration": 11.861,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the supplier access</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Supplier dependency brief Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Budget</span><strong>6 invented units</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Supplier task</span><strong>Publish programme; no registration export</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Required controls</span><strong>Programme-only expiry; managed secrets/updates; independent recovery</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Cost</span><strong>2 units per required control</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>What access fits a supplier publishing the programme?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The complete registration contact export</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A shared organiser account forever</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Programme publishing only, with expiry and revocation review</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-whole-dependency-chain-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "An owned dependency decision",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The team funds the required controls within the supplied budget and records what remains outside it. A minimum-access agreement and independent recovery test reduce exposure, but cannot promise uninterrupted service or eliminate supplier failure.",
