              "prompt": "Allocate the six-unit budget to the required safeguards.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"summary\"><output aria-live=\"polite\">Budget used: 0 / 6 units</output><p>Meet all three supplied requirements. Costs and priorities are invented for this case.</p></div><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Supplier gets programme-only access with expiry Â· 2 units</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Privately managed integration secrets with rotation and trusted updates Â· 2 units</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Independent recovery route and restoration test Â· 2 units</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Decorative security badge while sharing one organiser password Â· 3 units</span></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check dependency budget</button></div></div></div></section>",
