              "eyebrow": "Portal design and incident lab",
              "prompt": "Write the minimum-access and expiry agreement.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Supplier Â· task: publish the programme</span><select aria-label=\"Supplier Â· task: publish the programme\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Programme editing only; no registration export</option><option>Named service owner expires access and verifies revocation</option><option>Do not grant; contacts are outside the task</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Supplier work ends Friday</span><select aria-label=\"Supplier work ends Friday\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Programme editing only; no registration export</option><option>Named service owner expires access and verifies revocation</option><option>Do not grant; contacts are outside the task</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Supplier requests onward sharing of contacts</span><select aria-label=\"Supplier requests onward sharing of contacts\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Programme editing only; no registration export</option><option>Named service owner expires access and verifies revocation</option><option>Do not grant; contacts are outside the task</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your system assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked evidence alongside the earlier portal, timeline and recovery chapter records for your individual explanation. Your teacher reviews the viva separately. All tests use fictional offline models.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
