            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "The fictional supplier only publishes the programme. Budget: six exercise units. Meet the supplied requirements for limited access, managed secrets/trusted updates and independent recovery. Costs are invented, not vendor prices.",
              "eyebrow": "Portal design and incident lab",
              "prompt": "Handle an outage when the supplier also holds a recovery route.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"actionBank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Wait indefinitely because only the failed supplier has the recovery route</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Publish all integration secrets so anyone can recover the service</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Use the independently retained recovery route, involve the named owner and test restoration before reopening</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check decision</button></div></div></div></section>",
