                  "answer": 2,
                  "feedback": "The recovery route must work when this supplier is unavailable. Keep secrets private, involve the accountable owner and verify restored service and access before reopening.",
                  "success": "Outage response: use an independent recovery route with the named owner, preserve private secrets and test restoration before reopening. Document remaining supplier-outage risk and the next review rather than promising uninterrupted availability."
