            "familyAction": "Separate an observed event, a hypothesis and missing evidence. A log entry alone does not establish who acted."
          },
          "title": "Asha challenges the logs",
          "character": "Asha",
          "beginLabel": "Enter the system lab",
          "waitingText": "Story paused. Inspect the system evidence and test your decision.",
          "lockedHint": "Complete the system decision first.",
          "source": "app/module/cyber/lessons/new/story/chapters/when-logs-disagree.json",
          "duration": 96.999,
          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "when-logs-disagree-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "The logs disagree",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha receives four synthetic events from different portal components. One clock is known to run two minutes fast. A gateway records a successful response but does not record how many bytes reached the client. Another component records an access denial on a different path.",
              "dialogue": "Which conclusions are actually established?",
              "status": "Inspect the system",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 17.259,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/incident-recovery-room.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The logs disagree</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/incident-recovery-room.webp\" alt=\"Kabir orders synthetic event cards while Asha and a teacher compare dataset versions and a recovery checklist during a calm incident rehearsal.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Preserve the evidence, test restored records and permissions, and state what remains uncertain.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "when-logs-disagree-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "A name in a log is not a person",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "A session label identifies an account context, not necessarily the person at the keyboard. A successful status code alone does not prove the full file was received. Missing response-size evidence and a different request path limit the conclusion.",
              "dialogue": "Keep facts, hypotheses and unknowns separate.",
              "status": "Risk unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 17.909,
              "duration": 16.064,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A name in a log is not a person</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Supplied event ledger Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E1 Â· raw 14:00</span><strong>Identity service: session S7 authenticated as Asha</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E2 Â· raw 14:03</span><strong>Sharing service: public export link enabled in S7 context Â· clock two minutes fast</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E3 Â· raw 14:02</span><strong>Gateway: /export request returned 200; bytes not recorded</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E4 Â· raw 14:02</span><strong>App: /admin request denied 403; a different request path</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "when-logs-disagree-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Normalise before correlating",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Apply only the supplied clock correction, preserve raw times and compare request paths and session identifiers. Record alternative explanations such as session misuse or a path-specific denial. Do not invent missing records to force a neat story.",
              "dialogue": "Corrected time supports correlation, not certainty.",
              "status": "Build the control",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 34.623,
              "duration": 16.576,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Normalise before correlating</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Preserve raw records and apply only the known clock correction</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Separate observed fact, hypothesis and unknown</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A session label and status code do not establish full disclosure or attribution</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "when-logs-disagree-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose an evidence statement",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "A gateway log says status two hundred, but response bytes are unknown. Does that prove the entire registration file was stolen by the account holder? Choose the statement that matches the evidence limit.",
              "dialogue": "A successful response is an indicator, not complete attribution.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 51.849,
              "duration": 13.056,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose an evidence statement</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Supplied event ledger Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E1 Â· raw 14:00</span><strong>Identity service: session S7 authenticated as Asha</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E2 Â· raw 14:03</span><strong>Sharing service: public export link enabled in S7 context Â· clock two minutes fast</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E3 Â· raw 14:02</span><strong>Gateway: /export request returned 200; bytes not recorded</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E4 Â· raw 14:02</span><strong>App: /admin request denied 403; a different request path</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>A 200 response has unknown bytes. What is established?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The successful response was logged; full receipt and attribution remain unproved</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The account holder definitely stole every record</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The event must be harmless</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "when-logs-disagree-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "A careful evidence ledger",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The team keeps the request event as an observed fact, treats possible disclosure as a hypothesis and records missing bytes and attribution as unknowns. The initial alert still deserves proportionate verification and containment by authorised staff.",
              "dialogue": "Uncertainty does not mean ignoring the risk.",
              "status": "Evidence updated",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 65.555,
              "duration": 16.341,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A careful evidence ledger</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Supplied event ledger Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E1 Â· raw 14:00</span><strong>Identity service: session S7 authenticated as Asha</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E2 Â· raw 14:03</span><strong>Sharing service: public export link enabled in S7 context Â· clock two minutes fast</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E3 Â· raw 14:02</span><strong>Gateway: /export request returned 200; bytes not recorded</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>E4 Â· raw 14:02</span><strong>App: /admin request denied 403; a different request path</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "when-logs-disagree-6",
              "label": "Enter the lab",
              "title": "Enter the evidence lab",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Classify facts and hypotheses, correct the known clock offset and preserve a timeline with missing evidence. State at least one alternative explanation without investigating or accusing a real person.",
              "dialogue": "Let the evidence set the confidence.",
              "status": "Ready for practice",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 82.546,
              "duration": 13.803,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Enter the evidence lab</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Preserve raw records and apply only the known clock correction</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Separate observed fact, hypothesis and unknown</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A session label and status code do not establish full disclosure or attribution</s