ttribution not established</option><option>Missing evidence</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>The account holder personally caused the exposure</span><select aria-label=\"The account holder personally caused the exposure\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Observed log fact</option><option>Hypothesis requiring more evidence</option><option>Attribution not established</option><option>Missing evidence</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Response size and receiving party</span><select aria-label=\"Response size and receiving party\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Observed log fact</option><option>Hypothesis requiring more evidence</option><option>Attribution not established</option><option>Missing evidence</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></div></section>",
