            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Synthetic evidence only. E2â€™s clock is known to run two minutes fast; other clocks are aligned. Gateway status 200 has unknown response bytes; a 403 belongs to a different path. Preserve raw times and avoid personal attribution.",
              "eyebrow": "Portal design and incident lab",
              "prompt": "State an alternative explanation and the evidence still needed.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"actionBank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The named account holder certainly stole every record</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Possible session misuse or path-specific denial remains an alternative; obtain request/response and access evidence without accusing a person</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A 403 on another path proves no exposure occurred anywhere</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check decision</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your system assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked evidence alongside the earlier portal, timeline and recovery chapter records for your individual explanation. Your teacher reviews the viva separately. All tests use fictional offline models.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ChoiceTask",
                  "choices": [
                    "The named account holder certainly stole every record",
                    "Possible session misuse or path-specific denial remains an alternative; obtain request/response and access evidence without accusing a person",
                    "A 403 on another path proves no exposure occurred anywhere"
                  ],
                  "answer": 1,
                  "feedback": "The 403 concerns a different path, response bytes are unknown and a session does not establish its human operator. Retain alternatives and seek authorised evidence without accusation.",
                  "success": "Alternative explanation: a session may have been misused, and the 403 may reflect a different protected path. Correlate authorised request, response-size and access evidence; do not equate a session label with personal attribution or dismiss exposure from an unrelated denial."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "decisionTask": {
            "title": "Asha challenges the logs",
            "concepts": [
              "Preserve raw records and apply only the known clock correction",
              "Separate observed fact, hypothesis and unknown",
              "A session label and status code do not establish full disclosure or attribution"
