            "question": "A 200 response has unknown bytes. What is established?",
            "choices": [
              "The successful response was logged; full receipt and attribution remain unproved",
              "The account holder definitely stole every record",
              "The event must be harmless"
            ],
            "answer": 0,
            "why": "The log supplies a response status, not proof of complete receipt or the person behind the session. Investigate proportionately without inventing evidence."
          }
