              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Roles before improvisation",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The incident lead coordinates and escalates, the authorised service operator changes access, the evidence recorder preserves supplied records and the communications lead sends approved factual updates. Students rehearse roles; they do not administer a real school system.",
              "dialogue": "Ownership prevents conflicting actions.",
              "status": "Risk unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.394,
              "duration": 16.853,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Roles before improvisation</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Data-exposure inject Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Confirmed</span><strong>Public registration-export link in supplied settings</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Unresolved</span><strong>Full download scope and receiving party</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Responsible roles</span><strong>Incident lead Â· operator Â· recorder Â· communications lead</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Response</span><strong>Authorised containment and factual communication needed</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-breach-tabletop-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Contain and preserve",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Alert the responsible lead and retain available records. Use authorised controls to restrict the exposed link or session, record what changed and verify the restriction. Preserve evidence alongside urgent containment rather than delaying action for a perfect archive.",
              "dialogue": "Record the reason and time of each step.",
              "status": "Build the control",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 33.897,
              "duration": 17.728,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Contain and preserve</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Incident lead + operator + recorder + communications lead</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Preserve evidence alongside authorised containment</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Communicate known facts and scope under review</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-breach-tabletop-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose the first response",
