              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 52.275,
              "duration": 12.843,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 portal design room</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the first response</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-network\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"2\" y=\"16\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"9\" y=\"2\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M5 16v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h12a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3\"></path><path d=\"M12 12V8\"></path></svg><strong>Data-exposure inject Â· simulation</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Confirmed</span><strong>Public registration-export link in supplied settings</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Unresolved</span><strong>Full download scope and receiving party</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Responsible roles</span><strong>Incident lead Â· operator Â· recorder Â· communications lead</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Response</span><strong>Authorised containment and factual communication needed</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>Which initial response fits the supplied exposure?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Erase logs to tidy up</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Notify the authorised lead, preserve records and restrict exposure through the operator</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Accuse the account holder publicly</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models. No live scanning, exploitation, external messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-breach-tabletop-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "A factual stakeholder message",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The approved message states that a link was exposed and is now restricted, that scope is under review and where affected people can get help. It avoids naming a culprit or promising that no data was received.",
