          "practice": [
            {
              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "Supplied inject: public export link confirmed; complete download scope unknown. Rehearse authorised roles and preserve evidence alongside urgent containment. The simulation sends no messages and changes no service.",
              "eyebrow": "Portal design and incident lab",
              "prompt": "Allocate the four incident roles.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab illustratedActivity\"><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/incident-recovery-room.webp\" alt=\"Kabir orders synthetic event cards while Asha and a teacher compare dataset versions and a recovery checklist during a calm incident rehearsal.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/><figcaption>Preserve the evidence, test restored records and permissions, and state what remains uncertain.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Coordinate, authorise and escalate</span><select aria-label=\"Coordinate, authorise and escalate\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Incident lead</option><option>Authorised service operator</option><option>Evidence recorder</option><option>Communications lead</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Restrict link/session through approved controls</span><select aria-label=\"Restrict link/session through approved controls\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Incident lead</option><option>Authorised service operator</option><option>Evidence recorder</option><option>Communications lead</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Retain raw logs and record action times</span><select aria-label=\"Retain raw logs and record action times\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Incident lead</option><option>Authorised service operator</option><option>Evidence recorder</option><option>Communications lead</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Send approved factual stakeholder updates</span><select aria-label=\"Send approved factual stakeholder updates\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Incident lead</option><option>Authorised service operator</option><option>Evidence recorder</option><option>Communications lead</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your system assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked evidence alongside the earlier portal, timeline and recovery chapter records for your individual explanation. Your teacher reviews the viva separately. All tests use fictional offline models.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
