                    "Authorised service operator",
                    "Evidence recorder",
                    "Communications lead"
                  ],
                  "success": "Role allocation: incident lead coordinates/authorises/escalates; authorised operator restricts and verifies exposure; recorder retains raw records and action times; communications lead sends approved factual updates. Students only rehearse these roles."
                }
              ]
