                  "success": "Action log: notify authorised lead and preserve available evidence; operator restricts exposure and verifies the restriction; confirm known scope and send an approved factual update; record times, reasons and owners before recovery handoff. Preserve records alongside urgent containment, not as a reason to delay it."
