            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Supplied inject: public export link confirmed; complete download scope unknown. Rehearse authorised roles and preserve evidence alongside urgent containment. The simulation sends no messages and changes no service.",
              "eyebrow": "Portal design and incident lab",
              "prompt": "Choose a factual stakeholder message without accusation or guarantees.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"actionBank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">â€œA registration-export link was exposed and is now restricted. Scope is under review; use the approved contact for help. We will update you as facts are confirmed.â€</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">â€œAsha stole every record. Share her name publicly.â€</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">â€œNothing was received and no further action is needed; we have not checked.â€</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check decision</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your system assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked evidence alongside the earlier portal, timeline and recovery chapter records for your individual explanation. Your teacher reviews the viva separately. All tests use fictional offline models.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ChoiceTask",
                  "choices": [
                    "â€œA registration-export link was exposed and is now restricted. Scope is under review; use the approved contact for help. We will update you as facts are confirmed.â€",
                    "â€œAsha stole every record. Share her name publicly.â€",
                    "â€œNothing was received and no further action is needed; we have not checked.â€"
                  ],
                  "answer": 0,
                  "feedback": "Communicate the confirmed exposure and restriction, scope under review and approved help route. Do not attribute blame or guarantee no disclosure without evidence.",
                  "success": "Approved tabletop message: a registration-export link was exposed and is now restricted; scope is under review; use the approved help contact; further factual updates will follow. No person is accused and no unsupported no-disclosure guarantee is made. The exercise sends no message."
                }
              ]
            }
