            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Private managed secrets and trusted updates"
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Independent recovery with a named owner and exit"
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "What access fits a supplier publishing the programme?"
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The complete registration contact export"
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "A shared organiser account forever"
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Programme publishing only, with expiry and revocation review"
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The task does not need private registrations. Limit scope and duration and assign an owner to revoke and verify access."
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Asha challenges the logs"
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Preserve raw records and apply only the known clock correction"
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Separate observed fact, hypothesis and unknown"
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "A session label and status code do not establish full disclosure or attribution"
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "A 200 response has unknown bytes. What is established?"
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The successful response was logged; full receipt and attribution remain unproved"
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The account holder definitely stole every record"
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The event must be harmless"
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The log supplies a response status, not proof of complete receipt or the person behind the session. Investigate proportionately without inventing evidence."
            },
            {
              "line": 137,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Kabir runs the breach tabletop"
