            {
              "line": 139,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Name residual risk, owner and review point; teacher reviews the viva"
            },
            {
              "line": 139,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Maintenance explains a login alert, but a public export is independently confirmed. What changes?"
