            "familyAction": "Define a low-stakes decision, a non-AI comparator and error costs before looking at prepared results."
          },
          "title": "Asha sets the AI decision",
          "character": "Asha",
          "beginLabel": "Enter the AI assurance lab",
          "waitingText": "Story paused. Inspect the evidence and test your AI decision.",
          "lockedHint": "Complete the AI evidence decision first.",
          "source": "app/module/cyber/lessons/new/story/chapters/set-a-decision-and-a-baseline.json",
          "duration": 92.988,
          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "set-a-decision-and-a-baseline-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "Decide what the helper is for",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha frames a fictional library-enquiry helper. It suggests whether a request needs staff review; it never approves renewals or makes binding decisions. The team must define users, a comparator and acceptable errors before inspecting prepared scores.",
              "dialogue": "What decision will a prediction support?",
              "status": "Inspect the evidence",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 17.195,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evaluation-workshop.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Decide what the helper is for</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evaluation-workshop.webp\" alt=\"Asha and Kabir inspect a missed enquiry among anonymous cards while their teacher compares two prepared classifier-result sheets.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A high overall score can hide the few cases the decision most needs to catch. Compare errors with the stated goal.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-a-decision-and-a-baseline-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "A useful comparator",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The supplied pack has one hundred requests: five need staff review and ninety five are routine. An always-routine non-AI baseline looks accurate but misses every staff-review case. The team needs more than a headline percentage.",
              "dialogue": "Compare on the same cases and the same task.",
              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 17.845,
              "duration": 15.531,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A useful comparator</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Library decision brief Â· classroom pack</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Task / user</span><strong>Suggest staff review for library enquiries; staff keep decision authority</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Case pack</span><strong>100 synthetic cases: 5 staff-review, 95 routine</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Baseline</span><strong>Always routine, on the same cases</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Exercise criteria</span><strong>Recall â‰¥80%; â‰¤10 flagged/100; missed=5, extra review=1</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-a-decision-and-a-baseline-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Commit the acceptance plan",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "In this exercise, a missed staff-review case costs five invented units and an unnecessary review costs one. Staff can review at most ten flagged requests per hundred. The proposed minimum recall is eighty percent. These are classroom constraints, not universal targets.",
              "dialogue": "Write the goal before reading results.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 34.025,
              "duration": 17.877,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Commit the acceptance plan</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Low-stakes staff-review suggestion, not a binding decision</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Same-case non-AI baseline and explicit error costs</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Commit recall/capacity criteria before revealing scores</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-a-decision-and-a-baseline-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose a defensible plan",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Should the team choose whichever metric looks best after testing, compare different packs, or fix the task, baseline, costs and review capacity before inspecting the prepared results?",
              "dialogue": "A result should answer the question you set.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 52.553,
              "duration": 11.243,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose a defensible plan</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Library decision brief Â· classroom pack</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Task / user</span><strong>Suggest staff review for library enquiries; staff keep decision authority</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Case pack</span><strong>100 synthetic cases: 5 staff-review, 95 routine</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Baseline</span><strong>Always routine, on the same cases</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Exercise criteria</span><strong>Recall â‰¥80%; â‰¤10 flagged/100; missed=5, extra review=1</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>What should be fixed before inspecting the prepared results?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Whichever metric later looks best</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Task, comparator, costs and review capacity</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A promise that AI always wins</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-a-decision-and-a-baseline-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "A bounded brief",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha commits the library-staff use, always-routine comparator, error costs, recall target and review capacity. An uncertain request still has a staff route. The plan can now reveal whether a candidate meets the stated purpose.",
              "dialogue": "A polished answer is not an acceptance criterion.",
              "status": "Evidence updated",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 64.445,
              "duration": 15.467,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A bounded brief</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Library decision brief Â· classroom pack</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Task / user</span><strong>Suggest staff review for library enquiries; staff keep decision authority</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Case pack</span><strong>100 synthetic cases: 5 staff-review, 95 routine</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Baseline</span><strong>Always routine, on the same cases</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Exercise criteria</span><strong>Recall â‰¥80%; â‰¤10 flagged/100; missed=5, extra review=1</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "set-a-decision-and-a-baseline-6",
