          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "protect-the-evaluation-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "Keep evaluation independent",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir audits a supplied split of synthetic enquiries. The files are called training, validation and final test, but some related examples appear on both sides. Different filenames do not guarantee independent evidence.",
              "dialogue": "Look for related families, not only identical IDs.",
              "status": "Inspect the evidence",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 14.848,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evaluation-workshop.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Keep evaluation independent</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evaluation-workshop.webp\" alt=\"Asha and Kabir inspect a missed enquiry among anonymous cards while their teacher compares two prepared classifier-result sheets.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A high overall score can hide the few cases the decision most needs to catch. Compare errors with the stated goal.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-evaluation-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Two hidden overlaps",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "A paraphrase of family A sits in the final test while its original is in training. A related family D example also crosses training and final testing. These overlaps can make performance look stronger than it is.",
              "dialogue": "Related examples need a common partition.",
              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.498,
              "duration": 14.187,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Two hidden overlaps</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Leakage audit Â· classroom pack</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Family A</span><strong>S1 original in Training; S2 paraphrase in Final test</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Family D</span><strong>S5 in Final test; related S8 in Training</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Required correction</span><strong>Keep each family together; preserve non-empty partitions</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Final test</span><strong>Freeze candidate and manifest before independent final evaluation</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-evaluation-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Separate the roles",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Training examples fit the model, validation examples guide choices and the final test estimates the frozen candidate on unseen cases. Group related examples, record the manifest and keep final outcomes out of tuning. Repeatedly selecting on final results wears out that test.",
              "dialogue": "A final test is not another tuning screen.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 30.335,
              "duration": 18.453,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Separate the roles</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Training fits; validation guides choices; final test checks a frozen candidate</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Keep related families in one partition</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Answer-informed final cases need a fresh independent replacement</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-evaluation-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Repair the split",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Should Kabir rename duplicate files and keep the score, move related families together and freeze a manifest, or tune directly on the final answers?",
              "dialogue": "Protect independence before trusting the result.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 49.438,
              "duration": 9.6,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Repair the split</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Leakage audit Â· classroom pack</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Family A</span><strong>S1 original in Training; S2 paraphrase in Final test</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Family D</span><strong>S5 in Final test; related S8 in Training</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Required correction</span><strong>Keep each family together; preserve non-empty partitions</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Final test</span><strong>Freeze candidate and manifest before independent final evaluation</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>A paraphrase family crosses training and final test. What should Kabir do?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Rename the files and keep the split</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Tune on the final answers</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Group related examples together, audit the split and freeze a manifest</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-evaluation-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "A traceable manifest",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir groups the related records into the same partition and preserves all supplied examples. The final pack is frozen only after the leakage audit passes. This small demonstration teaches the split process; it does not train a real model.",
              "dialogue": "Record what moved and why.",
              "status": "Evidence updated",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 59.688,
              "duration": 15.851,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A traceable manifest</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Leakage audit Â· classroom pack</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Family A</span><strong>S1 original in Training; S2 paraphrase in Final test</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Family D</span><strong>S5 in Final test; related S8 in Training</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Required correction</span><strong>Keep each family together; preserve non-empty partitions</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Final test</span><strong>Freeze candidate and manifest before independent final evaluation</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "protect-the-evaluation-6",
              "label": "Enter the lab",
              "title": "Enter the split lab",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Match the three dataset roles, repair the two family overlaps and respond when final answers have already guided a revision. A fresh independent check is needed after that contamination.",
              "dialogue": "A clean-looking score needs a clean evaluation path.",
              "status": "Ready for practice",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 76.189,
              "duration": 12.352,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Enter the split lab</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Training fits; validation guides choices; final test checks a frozen candidate</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Keep related families in one partition</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Answer-informed final cases need a fresh independent replacement</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
