            {
              "stage": 1,
              "brief": "Synthetic enquiry families may contain duplicates, paraphrases or related views. Keep a family together. Training fits parameters; validation guides choices; final test evaluates a frozen candidate without answer-informed tuning.",
              "eyebrow": "AI evidence and assurance lab",
              "prompt": "Audit family overlap, repair the manifest and freeze a non-empty split.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">Audit the original manifest first. Keep each related family together, preserve every record and leave all three partitions non-empty. Several valid repairs exist; use the family evidence rather than treating a filename as independence.</p><div class=\"tableWrap\"><table class=\"table table splitTable\"><caption>Synthetic records Â· labels/results are not supplied for final-test tuning</caption><thead><tr><th>Record</th><th>Family / relationship</th><th>Partition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>S1</th><td>Family A<small>Original enquiry A</small></td><td><label class=\"srOnly\" for=\"split-S1\">Partition S1</label><select id=\"split-S1\" disabled=\"\"><option selected=\"\">Training</option><option>Validation</option><option>Final test</option></select></td></tr><tr><th>S2</th><td>Family A<small>Paraphrase of S1</small></td><td><label class=\"srOnly\" for=\"split-S2\">Partition S2</label><select id=\"split-S2\" disabled=\"\"><option>Training</option><option>Validation</option><option selected=\"\">Final test</option></select></td></tr><tr><th>S3</th><td>Family B<small>Independent enquiry B</small></td><td><label class=\"srOnly\" for=\"split-S3\">Partition S3</label><select id=\"split-S3\" disabled=\"\"><option selected=\"\">Training</option><option>Validation</option><option>Final test</option></select></td></tr><tr><th>S4</th><td>Family C<small>Independent enquiry C</small></td><td><label class=\"srOnly\" for=\"split-S4\">Partition S4</label><select id=\"split-S4\" disabled=\"\"><option>Training</option><option selected=\"\">Validation</option><option>Final test</option></select></td></tr><tr><th>S5</th><td>Family D<small>Original enquiry D</small></td><td><label class=\"srOnly\" for=\"split-S5\">Partition S5</label><select id=\"split-S5\" disabled=\"\"><option>Training</option><option>Validation</option><option selected=\"\">Final test</option></select></td></tr><tr><th>S6</th><td>Family E<small>Independent enquiry E</small></td><td><label class=\"srOnly\" for=\"split-S6\">Partition S6</label><select id=\"split-S6\" disabled=\"\"><option selected=\"\">Training</option><option>Validation</option><option>Final test</option></select></td></tr><tr><th>S7</th><td>Family F<small>Independent enquiry F</small></td><td><label class=\"srOnly\" for=\"split-S7\">Partition S7</label><select id=\"split-S7\" disabled=\"\"><option>Training</option><option selected=\"\">Validation</option><option>Final test</option></select></td></tr><tr><th>S8</th><td>Family D<small>Related version of S5</small></td><td><label class=\"srOnly\" for=\"split-S8\">Partition S8</label><select id=\"split-S8\" disabled=\"\"><option selected=\"\">Training</option><option>Validation</option><option>Final test</option></select></td></tr></tbody></table></div><button class=\"secondary\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg>Audit original split</button><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock-keyhole\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"16\" r=\"1\"></circle><rect x=\"3\" y=\"10\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3\"></path></svg>Freeze evaluation manifest</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked record with the moduleâ€™s baseline, manifest, calculations and model card for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All results are prepared classroom evidence.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            },
            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Synthetic enquiry families may contain duplicates, paraphrases or related views. Keep a family together. Training fits parameters; validation guides choices; final test evaluates a frozen candidate without answer-informed tuning.",
              "eyebrow": "AI evidence and assurance lab",
              "prompt": "Respond after final answers have already guided a revision.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"actionBank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Keep tuning on the final answers and call the score independent</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Rename the same test set to make it unseen again</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Preserve the contaminated result as development evidence and reserve fresh independent final cases after revision</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check decision</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked record with the moduleâ€™s baseline, manifest, calculations and model card for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All results are prepared classroom evidence.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ChoiceTask",
                  "choices": [
                    "Keep tuning on the final answers and call the score independent",
                    "Rename the same test set to make it unseen again",
                    "Preserve the contaminated result as development evidence and reserve fresh independent final cases after revision"
                  ],
                  "answer": 2,
                  "feedback": "Renaming or rerunning does not make answer-informed cases unseen. Keep the history and obtain a fresh independent final check.",
                  "success": "Leakage response: final answers used for revision are now development evidence; preserve that record, freeze the revised candidate and evaluate fresh independent final cases. Do not reuse the contaminated score as independent proof."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "decisionTask": {
            "title": "Kabir protects the evaluation",
            "concepts": [
              "Training fits; validation guides choices; final test checks a frozen candidate",
              "Keep related families in one partition",
              "Answer-informed final cases need a fresh independent replacement"
            ],
            "question": "A paraphrase family crosses training and final test. What should Kabir do?",
            "choices": [
              "Rename the files and keep the split",
              "Tune on the final answers",
              "Group related examples together, audit the split and freeze a manifest"
            ],
            "answer": 2,
            "why": "Different IDs can still be related. Keep the family together and protect final-test independence before trusting a score."
          }
        },
