          "practice": [
            {
              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "Prepared sheets, not a live model. Positive means staff review is required. Strict sheet: TP1, FP1, FN4, TN94. Accuracy=(TP+TN)/all; precision=TP/(TP+FP); recall=TP/(TP+FN). A zero denominator is undefined, not automatically zero.",
              "eyebrow": "AI evidence and assurance lab",
              "prompt": "Calculate the strict candidateâ€™s accuracy, precision and recall.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><table class=\"matrix\"><caption>Strict prepared candidate Â· positive means staff review required</caption><thead><tr><th>Actual class</th><th>Predicted review</th><th>Predicted routine</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Staff review needed</th><td>TP = 1</td><td>FN = 4</td></tr><tr><th>Routine</th><td>FP = 1</td><td>TN = 94</td></tr></tbody></table><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Accuracy (%)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Precision (%)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Recall (%)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"\"/></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check metric calculations</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked record with the moduleâ€™s baseline, manifest, calculations and model card for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All results are prepared classroom evidence.</p></div>",
