              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 13.653,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evaluation-workshop.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The same object looks different</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evaluation-workshop.webp\" alt=\"Asha and Kabir inspect a missed enquiry among anonymous cards while their teacher compares two prepared classifier-result sheets.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A high overall score can hide the few cases the decision most needs to catch. Compare errors with the stated goal.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
