              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 14.303,
              "duration": 13.696,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A changed input</h2><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"visionPreview\"><figure><div class=\"visionPhoto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative bright notebook input\" style=\"background-position:0% 0%\"></div><figcaption>Bright Â· supplied output: Notebook</figcaption></figure><figure><div class=\"visionPhoto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative dim notebook input\" style=\"background-position:50% 0%\"></div><figcaption>Dim Â· supplied output: Box</figcaption></figure><figure><div class=\"visionPhoto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative crop notebook input\" style=\"background-position:100% 0%\"></div><figcaption>Crop Â· supplied output: Needs review</figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"callout\">Illustrative inputs and prepared predictions only. No live model is executed or measured.</p></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "vision-networks-and-changing-inputs-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Features, layers and use",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Features describe patterns in the input. Layers transform representations. Training adjusts parameters using examples; inference uses the learned parameters on a new input. A confidence score is not a guarantee, and this activity does not reveal the internal workings of a real network.",
              "dialogue": "Concepts help explain the test, not prove a result.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 28.649,
              "duration": 18.88,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Features, layers and use</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Features and layers represent/transform inputs</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Training changes parameters; inference applies them</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Six illustrative views support a narrow observation only</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
