              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the claim</h2><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"visionPreview\"><figure><div class=\"visionPhoto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative bright notebook input\" style=\"background-position:0% 0%\"></div><figcaption>Bright Â· supplied output: Notebook</figcaption></figure><figure><div class=\"visionPhoto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative dim notebook input\" style=\"background-position:50% 0%\"></div><figcaption>Dim Â· supplied output: Box</figcaption></figure><figure><div class=\"visionPhoto\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Illustrative crop notebook input\" style=\"background-position:100% 0%\"></div><figcaption>Crop Â· supplied output: Needs review</figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"callout\">Illustrative inputs and prepared predictions only. No live model is executed or measured.</p></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>What can these six prepared image/prediction pairs establish?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Robustness for every real image</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">A narrow observation of changed outputs and review cases, with follow-up needed</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">That all dim inputs always fail</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled