              "prompt": "Connect features, layers, training and inference to their roles.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Patterns such as edges, texture or representation coordinates</span><select aria-label=\"Patterns such as edges, texture or representation coordinates\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Features</option><option>Layers</option><option>Training</option><option>Inference</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Successive transformations of an input representation</span><select aria-label=\"Successive transformations of an input representation\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Features</option><option>Layers</option><option>Training</option><option>Inference</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Adjust learned parameters from examples</span><select aria-label=\"Adjust learned parameters from examples\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Features</option><option>Layers</option><option>Training</option><option>Inference</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Use the learned parameters on a new input</span><select aria-label=\"Use the learned parameters on a new input\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Features</option><option>Layers</option><option>Training</option><option>Inference</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked record with the moduleâ€™s baseline, manifest, calculations and model card for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All results are prepared classroom evidence.</p></div>",
