                    "Layers",
                    "Training",
                    "Inference"
                  ],
                  "success": "Network concepts: features represent input patterns; layers transform representations; training adjusts parameters; inference applies learned parameters. Confidence is not correctness, and this activity does not train or execute a network."
                }
