              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 14.848,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evidence-workbench.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A fluent research answer</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evidence-workbench.webp\" alt=\"Asha checks a source passage against a laptop answer while Kabir sets aside an instruction slip and a teacher helps review the evidence.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Check the passage behind the citation, keep source data below instruction authority and retain a human decision point.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-source-grounded-research-assistant-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "What the pack actually says",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The pack gives weekday desk hours, says staff review renewal requests and forbids identity scans in this classroom workflow. It gives no weekend schedule. A generated answer invents guaranteed renewals and weekend hours while citing those pages.",
              "dialogue": "A citation label alone is not evidence.",
              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.498,
              "duration": 16.128,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">What the pack actually says</h2><div class=\"sources\"><article><strong>P1 Â· Fictional library desk notice</strong><p>The library enquiry desk is open Mondayâ€“Friday, 10:00â€“16:00. No weekend schedule is supplied in this pack.</p></article><article><strong>P2 Â· Fictional renewal process</strong><p>Authorised library staff review each renewal request. Renewals are not guaranteed; individual exceptions go to staff.</p></article><article><strong>P3 Â· Classroom data boundary</strong><p>Use synthetic examples only. Do not request identity scans, reveal private notes or disclose individual borrowing records to an unauthorised requester.</p></article></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-source-grounded-research-assistant-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Answer, abstain or escalate",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Answer supported questions with the matching passage. Say when the pack does not establish a fact. Refer individual exceptions to authorised staff, and refuse unauthorised private-record requests rather than collecting more personal data.",
              "dialogue": "Use the source and the authority boundary together.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 32.276,
              "duration": 15.701,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Answer, abstain or escalate</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Retrieval selects passages; generation produces text</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Read the passage behind the citation</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Answer supported facts; abstain/refuse/escalate when needed</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-source-grounded-research-assistant-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Check a confident claim",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "The answer promises every renewal is guaranteed and cites the staff-review passage. Is the guarantee supported, is any citation enough, or does that passage contradict the guarantee?",
