              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 48.627,
              "duration": 12.267,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Check a confident claim</h2><div class=\"sources\"><article><strong>P1 Â· Fictional library desk notice</strong><p>The library enquiry desk is open Mondayâ€“Friday, 10:00â€“16:00. No weekend schedule is supplied in this pack.</p></article><article><strong>P2 Â· Fictional renewal process</strong><p>Authorised library staff review each renewal request. Renewals are not guaranteed; individual exceptions go to staff.</p></article><article><strong>P3 Â· Classroom data boundary</strong><p>Use synthetic examples only. Do not request identity scans, reveal private notes or disclose individual borrowing records to an unauthorised requester.</p></article></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>P2 says staff review renewals and they are not guaranteed. What about â€œall renewals are guaranteed [P2]â€?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Any citation makes it supported</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Keep the guarantee because it is fluent</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The cited passage contradicts the guarantee</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
