              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "Fixed fictional school-source pack P1â€“P3. Retrieval selects passages; generation creates an answer. A displayed citation is useful only when that passage supports the claim. No real library or student records are accessed.",
              "eyebrow": "AI evidence and assurance lab",
              "prompt": "Check each claim against its cited passage.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab illustratedActivity\"><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evidence-workbench.webp\" alt=\"Asha checks a source passage against a laptop answer while Kabir sets aside an instruction slip and a teacher helps review the evidence.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/><figcaption>Check the passage behind the citation, keep source data below instruction authority and retain a human decision point.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"sources\"><article><strong>P1 Â· Fictional library desk notice</strong><p>The library enquiry desk is open Mondayâ€“Friday, 10:00â€“16:00. No weekend schedule is supplied in this pack.</p></article><article><strong>P2 Â· Fictional renewal process</strong><p>Authorised library staff review each renewal request. Renewals are not guaranteed; individual exceptions go to staff.</p></article><article><strong>P3 Â· Classroom data boundary</strong><p>Use synthetic examples only. Do not request identity scans, reveal private notes or disclose individual borrowing records to an unauthorised requester.</p></article></div><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>â€œThe weekday desk closes at 16:00â€ [P1]</span><select aria-label=\"â€œThe weekday desk closes at 16:00â€ [P1]\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Supported by the cited passage</option><option>Contradicted by the cited passage</option><option>Not established by this pack</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>â€œEvery renewal is guaranteedâ€ [P2]</span><select aria-label=\"â€œEvery renewal is guaranteedâ€ [P2]\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Supported by the cited passage</option><option>Contradicted by the cited passage</option><option>Not established by this pack</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>â€œWeekend hours end at 18:00â€ [P1]</span><select aria-label=\"â€œWeekend hours end at 18:00â€ [P1]\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Supported by the cited passage</option><option>Contradicted by the cited passage</option><option>Not established by this pack</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>â€œUpload a full identity scan hereâ€ [P3]</span><select aria-label=\"â€œUpload a full identity scan hereâ€ [P3]\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Supported by the cited passage</option><option>Contradicted by the cited passage</option><option>Not established by this pack</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></div></section>",
