              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"sources\"><article><strong>P1 Â· Fictional library desk notice</strong><p>The library enquiry desk is open Mondayâ€“Friday, 10:00â€“16:00. No weekend schedule is supplied in this pack.</p></article><article><strong>P2 Â· Fictional renewal process</strong><p>Authorised library staff review each renewal request. Renewals are not guaranteed; individual exceptions go to staff.</p></article><article><strong>P3 Â· Classroom data boundary</strong><p>Use synthetic examples only. Do not request identity scans, reveal private notes or disclose individual borrowing records to an unauthorised requester.</p></article></div><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Supported hours sentence</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option value=\"wrong\">Weekend desk closes at 18:00 [P1]</option><option value=\"P1\">Weekday desk opens 10:00â€“16:00 [P1]</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Supported renewal sentence</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option value=\"wrong\">All renewals are guaranteed [P2]</option><option value=\"P2\">Authorised staff review renewals; no guarantee [P2]</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Weekend evidence gap</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option value=\"guess\">Invent weekend hours to finish the answer</option><option value=\"unknown\">Weekend hours are not supplied; seek an authorised updated notice</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Save source-grounded answer</button></div></div></div></section>",
