              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "An average hides a gap",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha reviews two supplied input groups for the same low-stakes library task. Each has ten examples with five staff-review cases. One group contains full-text enquiries; the other contains abbreviated or alternative-format text.",
