              "status": "Inspect the evidence",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 16.149,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evidence-workbench.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">An average hides a gap</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ai-evidence-workbench.webp\" alt=\"Asha checks a source passage against a laptop answer while Kabir sets aside an instruction slip and a teacher helps review the evidence.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Check the passage behind the citation, keep source data below instruction authority and retain a human decision point.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "who-benefits-who-is-missed-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Who is missed",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The prepared results find four of five staff-review cases in group A and two of five in group B. That is eighty percent versus forty percent recall in these tiny groups. The gap does not by itself establish a cause or a universal claim about people.",
              "dialogue": "A group result is evidence to investigate.",
              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.799,
              "duration": 16.256,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Who is missed</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Group-level evidence Â· classroom pack</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Group A Â· full text</span><strong>TP4, FN1 â†’ recall 4/5 = 80%</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Group B Â· alternative format</span><strong>TP2, FN3 â†’ recall 2/5 = 40%</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Sample limit</span><strong>10 cases per group; cause and general fairness not established</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Mitigation</span><strong>Accessible staff route, user review, fresh independent evaluation</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "who-benefits-who-is-missed-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Write the model card",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Record intended use, synthetic-data provenance, evaluation counts, group and shift limitations and a human override. Keep an accessible manual route. Check permission to use source material and provide attribution; a citation alone does not establish permission.",
              "dialogue": "The assurance pack includes limits and responsibilities.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 33.705,
              "duration": 17.109,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 AI assurance desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Write the model card</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Group A recall 4/5; group B recall 2/5</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Tiny samples do not establish cause or general fairness</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Accessible manual route, model card and stop-use owner</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and prepared results only. No live AI, private student data, paid API or external tool action.</small></div>"
