              "prompt": "Calculate group recall from the actual denominators.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><table class=\"matrix\"><caption>Prepared input groups Â· each has 10 examples, 5 true staff-review cases</caption><thead><tr><th>Group</th><th>TP / FN</th><th>FP / TN</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A Â· Full-text enquiries</th><td>4 / 1</td><td>1 / 4</td></tr><tr><th>B Â· Abbreviated / alternative-format enquiries</th><td>2 / 3</td><td>1 / 4</td></tr></tbody></table><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Group A recall (%)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Group B recall (%)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"\"/></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check group recall</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked record with the moduleâ€™s baseline, manifest, calculations and model card for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All results are prepared classroom evidence.</p></div>",
