              "prompt": "Complete the model card and human override/stop-use point.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Intended use and decision maker</span><select aria-label=\"Intended use and decision maker\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Low-stakes staff-review suggestion; staff decide exceptions</option><option>Synthetic classroom examples and authorised source pack, with attribution</option><option>Tiny groups; B recall 2/5 and limited changed-input evidence</option><option>Staff review uncertainty; stop affected automation if privacy or authority fails</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Data provenance and permitted scope</span><select aria-label=\"Data provenance and permitted scope\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Low-stakes staff-review suggestion; staff decide exceptions</option><option>Synthetic classroom examples and authorised source pack, with attribution</option><option>Tiny groups; B recall 2/5 and limited changed-input evidence</option><option>Staff review uncertainty; stop affected automation if privacy or authority fails</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Known limitation</span><select aria-label=\"Known limitation\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Low-stakes staff-review suggestion; staff decide exceptions</option><option>Synthetic classroom examples and authorised source pack, with attribution</option><option>Tiny groups; B recall 2/5 and limited changed-input evidence</option><option>Staff review uncertainty; stop affected automation if privacy or authority fails</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Human override and stop-use condition</span><select aria-label=\"Human override and stop-use condition\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Low-stakes staff-review suggestion; staff decide exceptions</option><option>Synthetic classroom examples and authorised source pack, with attribution</option><option>Tiny groups; B recall 2/5 and limited changed-input evidence</option><option>Staff review uncertainty; stop affected automation if privacy or authority fails</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked record with the moduleâ€™s baseline, manifest, calculations and model card for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All results are prepared classroom evidence.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
