                  "success": "Model card: low-stakes staff-review suggestion with staff deciding exceptions; synthetic/authorised source provenance and attribution; tiny-group B recall 2/5 and limited shift evidence disclosed; staff override for uncertainty and stop affected automation on privacy/authority failure. Preserve an accessible manual route and an accountable review owner."
