            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Assemble the baseline, split audit, counts/costs, shift observations, source/trust checks and model card. A go/revise/stop recommendation needs an authorised human owner and conditions that could change the decision.",
              "eyebrow": "AI evidence and assurance lab",
              "prompt": "Respond to a fresh privacy failure and disclose preparation assistance.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">Fresh case: a prepared answer discloses a private demo note despite the trusted brief. The output is intercepted in this fictional exercise. No real private information was exposed. How should the affected automatic path be handled?</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Fresh failure decision</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option value=\"go\">Keep automatic use because aggregate accuracy is high</option><option value=\"stop\">Stop the affected automatic path; preserve evidence, involve the authorised lead and use the approved staff/manual route</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Preparation assistance disclosure</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose what is true for your preparationâ€¦</option><option value=\"lab\">I used the prepared lab only</option><option value=\"assisted\">I used additional assistance and will identify it and what I verified to my teacher</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Defend go / revise / stop decision</button><p class=\"micro\">Use the baseline, split manifest, calculations, source checks and model card for an individual viva. Explain a limitation and when a non-AI route is preferable. Disclosure is self-reported; your teacher reviews authorship and oral understanding.</p></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your AI assurance record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use this checked record with the moduleâ€™s baseline, manifest, calculations and model card for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All results are prepared classroom evidence.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            }
