            {
              "line": 126,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Facts, privacy and decision authority need separate evaluation."
            },
            {
              "line": 127,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "hide"
            },
            {
              "line": 127,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Hide the weak group and report only the 95% headline"
            },
            {
              "line": 127,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Removing inconvenient evidence makes the recommendation misleading."
            },
            {
              "line": 130,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Choose the metric after seeing which result is highest"
            },
            {
              "line": 130,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Compare a documented non-AI route on the same cases and prefer it when it better fits the stated costs, capacity or privacy limits"
            },
            {
              "line": 130,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Assume AI is preferable whenever the output is fluent"
            },
            {
              "line": 130,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Use the same task, cases and costs. A simpler non-AI or manual route may be preferable when it meets the purpose with fewer unsupported assumptions."
            },
            {
              "line": 130,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Baseline plan: compare on the same cases and labels; state error costs, review capacity and privacy scope first. Prefer the non-AI/manual route when it better fits those requirements rather than treating AI as the default."
            },
            {
              "line": 131,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Keep tuning on the final answers and call the score independent"
            },
            {
              "line": 131,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Rename the same test set to make it unseen again"
            },
            {
              "line": 131,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Preserve the contaminated result as development evidence and reserve fresh independent final cases after revision"
            },
            {
              "line": 131,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Renaming or rerunning does not make answer-informed cases unseen. Keep the history and obtain a fresh independent final check."
            },
            {
              "line": 131,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Leakage response: final answers used for revision are now development evidence; preserve that record, freeze the revised candidate and evaluate fresh independent final cases. Do not reuse the contaminated score as independent proof."
            },
            {
              "line": 132,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Always-routine baseline: cost 5, under the new cost-only goal with no minimum recall requirement"
            },
            {
              "line": 132,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Strict candidate: cost 9, because its name sounds safer"
