            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "The current pack has B recall 2/5 and limited shift evidence. One acceptable operating point does not establish all requirements or justify hiding gaps."
            },
            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Recommendation: revise before wider use; preserve the baseline and all results, address group/accessibility and shift gaps, retain the manual staff route, assign an authorised review point and collect fresh independent evidence. Do not deploy from a headline score alone."
            },
            {
              "line": 138,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Low-stakes library-enquiry task: suggest staff review versus routine. On the supplied 100-case pack, 5 need staff review. Exercise costs: missed=5, extra review=1. Capacity: 10 flagged cases per 100. Set criteria before revealing the prepared results."
            },
            {
              "line": 138,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Build the measurable decision brief and comparator."
