            {
              "line": 138,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Explain when the non-AI comparator is preferable."
            },
            {
              "line": 139,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Synthetic enquiry families may contain duplicates, paraphrases or related views. Keep a family together. Training fits parameters; validation guides choices; final test evaluates a frozen candidate without answer-informed tuning."
