            },
            {
              "line": 140,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Prepared sheets, not a live model. Positive means staff review is required. Strict sheet: TP1, FP1, FN4, TN94. Accuracy=(TP+TN)/all; precision=TP/(TP+FP); recall=TP/(TP+FN). A zero denominator is undefined, not automatically zero."
