              "id": "choose-the-right-data-model-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose the support model",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "For first-come support, should the newest ticket jump ahead, should names determine identity, or should the earliest waiting ticket be served from a queue?",
              "dialogue": "The structure should express the required policy.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 52.851,
              "duration": 9.024,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the support model</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Desk operation cards Â· synthetic exercise</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Ordered programme</span><strong>List Â· position is not identity</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Registration record</span><strong>Stable-key lookup after conflicts resolved</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Undo U1, U2, U3</span><strong>Next removal U3 Â· stack</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Support T1, T2, T3</span><strong>Next removal T1 Â· queue</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>Which model fits first-come support?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Newest ticket jumps ahead automatically</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Match identity by name alone</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Queue: serve the earliest waiting ticket first</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
