              "caption": "Kabir records valid outputs and the reason each invalid input was quarantined. The ledger remembers committed event IDs so a retry can distinguish an already handled event from a conflicting reuse of that ID. This is a classroom model, not a distributed delivery guarantee.",
              "dialogue": "Record both success and unresolved work.",
              "status": "Evidence updated",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 61.587,
              "duration": 17.984,
