ut</strong><span>Ledger, quarantine and checkpoint log</span></div></li></ol><p>Invalid or conflicting input is quarantined with a reason. An output fault stops with completed IDs and pending work preserved. This diagram sends no alerts.</p></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
