                  "success": "Contracts: original synthetic input with stable ID/category/supplied score; Axx/supported category/finite 0â€“100 validation and conflict hold; â‰¥70 Review versus lower Record only transformation; output ledger plus quarantine reasons and checkpoint/pending log. Missing values are never invented."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Offline synthetic alerts: ID A plus two digits, category latency/outage, finite priority score 0â€“100. Exercise rule: score â‰¥70 â†’ human Review, otherwise Record only. Keep originals, quarantine and a retry-safe ledger; no messages are sent.",
              "eyebrow": "Reliable automation lab",
              "prompt": "Run mixed valid/invalid inputs and preserve the unresolved records.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption>Offline alerts pipeline Â· explicit contracts at every handoff</figcaption><ol><li><div><strong>Input</strong><span>Preserve original batch</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><div><strong>Validate</strong><span>Schema, stable IDs and conflict checks</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><div><strong>Transform</strong><span>Apply the stated review threshold</span></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><div><strong>Output</strong><span>Ledger, quarantine and checkpoint log</span></div></li></ol><p>Invalid or conflicting input is quarantined with a reason. An output fault stops with completed IDs and pending work preserved. This diagram sends no alerts.</p></figure><div class=\"result\"><h3>Preserved synthetic input</h3><pre>[\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;A01&quot;,\n    &quot;category&quot;: &quot;latency&quot;,\n    &quot;value&quot;: 70\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;A02&quot;,\n    &quot;category&quot;: &quot;outage&quot;,\n    &quot;value&quot;: 40\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;A03&quot;,\n    &quot;category&quot;: &quot;latency&quot;,\n    &quot;value&quot;: 101\n  },\n  {\n    &quot;id&quot;: &quot;A04&quot;,\n    &quot;category&quot;: &quot;mystery&quot;,\n    &quot;value&quot;: 80\n  }\n]</pre></div><button class=\"secondary\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg>Run mixed alert batch</button><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Interpret invalid-record handling</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option value=\"drop\">Silently remove invalid rows and discard the originals</option><option value=\"quarantine\">Quarantine with reasons and preserve the original batch</option><option value=\"zero\">Invent score zero for invalid rows</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Save pipeline contract test</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your automation evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use the checked records across the module for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All traces are fictional offline models.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            }
          ],
          "decisionTask": {
            "title": "Kabir builds the alerts pipeline",
            "concepts": [
              "Preserve input â†’ validate/quarantine â†’ transform â†’ ledger/log",
              "Score â‰¥70 is the invented review boundary",
              "Keep invalid/conflicting input visible; no external output"
            ],
            "question": "What should happen to an invalid score?",
            "choices": [
              "Change it silently to zero",
              "Delete the source row",
              "Quarantine with a reason while preserving the original"
            ],
            "answer": 2,
            "why": "A missing or invalid score must not be invented or hidden. Quarantine preserves evidence and makes the failure visible."
          }
