          "character": "Asha",
          "beginLabel": "Enter the reliability lab",
          "waitingText": "Story paused. Trace the workflow and test your decision.",
          "lockedHint": "Complete the reliability decision first.",
          "source": "app/module/cyber/lessons/new/story/chapters/make-failure-visible.json",
          "duration": 95.249,
          "scenes": [
            {
              "id": "make-failure-visible-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "The output stops halfway",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha runs a synthetic batch with three valid alerts. The first output commits, then the prepared output fault stops the second. A reliable workflow must identify what succeeded and what remains pending.",
              "dialogue": "Partial success is different from complete success.",
              "status": "Inspect the workflow",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 13.867,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ct-alerts-pipeline.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The output stops halfway</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/ct-alerts-pipeline.webp\" alt=\"Students arrange input, validation, processing and output trays, with a separate invalid-record review tray and a preserved original folder.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A reliable workflow records valid outputs, quarantined inputs and unfinished work without hiding the original evidence.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "make-failure-visible-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Do not erase the checkpoint",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "Deleting the output history before retrying can repeat the first output. Ignoring the stop can lose the remaining records. Preserve the input batch, committed IDs and pending work while the authorised operator resolves the fault.",
              "dialogue": "A safe retry starts from preserved evidence.",
              "status": "Risk unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 14.517,
              "duration": 14.997,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Do not erase the checkpoint</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Checkpointed failure trace Â· synthetic exercise</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>First run</span><strong>A01 committed; output fault before A02</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Pending</span><strong>A02 and A03 retained</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>After fault resolution</span><strong>Retry preserved batch; skip identical committed A01</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Completed retry</span><strong>A01, A02 and A03 each present once in the model ledger</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "make-failure-visible-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Choose the failure response",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Empty input should produce an explicit no-change result. Malformed data goes to quarantine. An unavailable output stops the batch with a checkpoint; retry only after the underlying fault is resolved. A changed payload under an existing ID needs review, not overwrite.",
              "dialogue": "Different failures need different actions.",
              "status": "Build the contract",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 30.164,
              "duration": 18.133,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the failure response</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Preserve committed IDs and pending input</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Stop on output failure; retry after resolution</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Skip identical committed events; quarantine changed payloads</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "make-failure-visible-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose the retry plan",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Should Asha delete the ledger and start again, pretend the whole batch succeeded, or retry the preserved batch after the fault is resolved while skipping already committed identical events?",
              "dialogue": "Keep pending work and completed work distinct.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 48.947,
              "duration": 11.669,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the retry plan</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Checkpointed failure trace Â· synthetic exercise</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>First run</span><strong>A01 committed; output fault before A02</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Pending</span><strong>A02 and A03 retained</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>After fault resolution</span><strong>Retry preserved batch; skip identical committed A01</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Completed retry</span><strong>A01, A02 and A03 each present once in the model ledger</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>After A01 commits and A02 fails, what is the safe retry plan?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Retry the preserved batch after fault resolution, skipping already committed identical A01</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Erase the ledger and pretend nothing committed</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Mark the entire batch complete</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "make-failure-visible-5",
              "label": "What changes",
              "title": "A visible recovery trace",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "The model keeps A01 committed and marks A02 and A03 pending. On retry, it skips the identical A01 event and commits the remaining two. All three unique outputs are present, and no real notification was ever sent.",
              "dialogue": "The action log explains what the retry changed.",
              "status": "Evidence updated",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 61.267,
              "duration": 16.427,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A visible recovery trace</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Checkpointed failure trace Â· synthetic exercise</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>First run</span><strong>A01 committed; output fault before A02</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Pending</span><strong>A02 and A03 retained</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>After fault resolution</span><strong>Retry preserved batch; skip identical committed A01</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Completed retry</span><strong>A01, A02 and A03 each present once in the model ledger</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "make-failure-visible-6",
              "label": "Enter the lab",
              "title": "Enter the failure lab",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Classify the fault pack, run the partial-failure simulation and inspect the retry. Then respond to an existing ID arriving with different content. The model demonstrates retry safety without promising real-world exactly-once delivery.",
              "dialogue": "Make the unresolved work visible.",
              "status": "Ready for practice",
              "tone": "resolved",
              "start": 78.343,
              "duration": 16.256,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Enter the failure lab</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Preserve committed IDs and pending input</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Stop on output failure; retry after resolution</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Skip identical committed events; quarantine changed payloads</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
            }
          ],
          "practice": [
            {
              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "Rehearse empty input, malformed records, identical repeats and partial output failure. Stop with a checkpoint on output failure and retry only after its cause is resolved. Conflicting event content requires review.",
              "eyebrow": "Reliable automation lab",
              "prompt": "Map each fault to a visible safe response.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Input is an empty list</span><select aria-label=\"Input is an empty list\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Explicit no-change result</option><option>Quarantine with reason; preserve original</option><option>Skip the already committed event and log the repeat</option><option>Stop with checkpoint; retry pending work after the fault is resolved</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Score is missing, text or outside the allowed range</span><select aria-label=\"Score is missing, text or outside the allowed range\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Explicit no-change result</option><option>Quarantine with reason; preserve original</option><option>Skip the already committed event and log the repeat</option><option>Stop with checkpoint; retry pending work after the fault is resolved</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Same ID and identical content arrives after commit</span><select aria-label=\"Same ID and identical content arrives after commit\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Explicit no-change result</option><option>Quarantine with reason; preserve original</option><option>Skip the already committed event and log the repeat</option><option>Stop with checkpoint; retry pending work after the fault is resolved</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Output becomes unavailable halfway through</span><select aria-label=\"Output becomes unavailable halfway through\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Explicit no-change result</option><option>Quarantine with reason; preserve original</option><option>Skip the already committed event and log the repeat</option><option>Stop with checkpoint; retry pending work after the fault is resolved</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your automation evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use the checked records across the module for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All traces are fictional offline models.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "MatchTable",
                  "rows": [
                    {
                      "label": "Input is an empty list",
                      "answer": "Explicit no-change result",
                      "why": "An empty batch is handled without inventing output or treating it as a crash."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "Score is missing, text or outside the allowed range",
                      "answer": "Quarantine with reason; preserve original",
                      "why": "Do not coerce missing values to zero or silently drop them."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "Same ID and identical content arrives after commit",
                      "answer": "Skip the already committed event and log the repeat",
                      "why": "Retry should not duplicate an already recorded identical output."
                    },
                    {
                      "label": "Output becomes unavailable halfway through",
                      "answer": "Stop with checkpoint; retry pending work after the fault is resolved",
                      "why": "Preserve both completed output and pending input."
                    }
                  ],
                  "options": [
                    "Explicit no-change result",
                    "Quarantine with reason; preserve original",
                    "Skip the already committed event and log the repeat",
                    "Stop with checkpoint; retry pending work after the fault is resolved"
                  ],
                  "success": "Fault plan: empty batch â†’ explicit no change; malformed record â†’ quarantine with original and reason; identical committed repeat â†’ skip/log; output failure â†’ stop with checkpoint and retry only after resolution. Completed and pending work remain distinct."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "stage": 1,
              "brief": "Rehearse empty input, malformed records, identical repeats and partial output failure. Stop with a checkpoint on output failure and retry only after its cause is resolved. Conflicting event content requires review.",
              "eyebrow": "Reliable automation lab",
              "prompt": "Run a prepared partial failure, then retry the preserved batch.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"callout\">Prepared fault occurs before A02 commits. First run commits A01; A02/A03 remain pending. The retry represents an authorised operator having resolved this output fault. No actual notification is ever sent.</p><button class=\"secondary\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg>Run with output fault</button><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Recovery plan after the fault is resolved</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option value=\"erase\">Erase the ledger and mark everything complete</option><option value=\"preserve\">Retry the preserved batch with the committed ledger</option></select></label><button class=\"secondary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg>Retry preserved batch</button><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Save failure recovery</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your automation evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use the checked records across the module for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All traces are fictional offline models.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            },
            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "Rehearse empty input, malformed records, identical repeats and partial output failure. Stop with a checkpoint on output failure and retry only after its cause is resolved. Conflicting event content requires review.",
              "eyebrow": "Reliable automation lab",
              "prompt": "Handle changed content arriving under an already committed ID.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"actionBank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Overwrite committed A01 score 70 with the new score 5</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Delete the source batch so the conflict disappears</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Quarantine the changed A01 payload, preserve prior output and both source versions, and seek authorised review</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check decision</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your automation evidence record</h2><ol></ol><p>Use the checked records across the module for your teacherâ€™s individual review. Automatic checks assess structured decisions, not authorship or the oral defence. All traces are fictional offline models.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ChoiceTask",
                  "choices": [
                    "Overwrite committed A01 score 70 with the new score 5",
                    "Delete the source batch so the conflict disappears",
                    "Quarantine the changed A01 payload, preserve prior output and both source versions, and seek authorised review"
