                  "answer": 2,
                  "feedback": "Retry safety applies to identical content. Different content under an existing ID is a conflict, not permission to overwrite history.",
                  "success": "Conflict handling: changed content under A01 is quarantined for authorised review; prior output and both source versions remain. Do not silently overwrite a committed event or treat a changed payload as an identical retry."
