            "question": "After A01 commits and A02 fails, what is the safe retry plan?",
            "choices": [
              "Retry the preserved batch after fault resolution, skipping already committed identical A01",
              "Erase the ledger and pretend nothing committed",
              "Mark the entire batch complete"
            ],
            "answer": 0,
            "why": "Preserve the checkpoint and pending records. An identical committed event is skipped on retry; unresolved output is not lost or called complete."
