              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Read the supplied windows",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "Window A has twenty flagged records among one hundred observed readings in one hour, with no missing readings. Window B has thirty flags among three hundred observed readings in three hours, plus fifteen missing readings.",
              "dialogue": "Missing is not another word for normal.",
              "status": "Risk unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 15.135,
              "duration": 13.717,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Read the supplied windows</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Observed alert windows Â· synthetic exercise</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Window A Â· 1h</span><strong>20/100 observed = 20% Â· 0 missing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Window B Â· 3h</span><strong>30/300 observed = 10% Â· 15 missing</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
