              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose the causal claim",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Do these two windows prove that the new rule caused any change, or do different workloads, windows and missingness leave alternative explanations? Choose the statement supported by this observational pack.",
              "dialogue": "Association alone does not establish the cause.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 46.067,
              "duration": 13.205,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 reliable automation lab</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the causal claim</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-workflow\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><rect width=\"8\" height=\"8\" x=\"13\" y=\"13\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><strong>Observed alert windows Â· synthetic exercise</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Window A Â· 1h</span><strong>20/100 observed = 20% Â· 0 missing</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Window B Â· 3h</span><strong>30/300 observed = 10% Â· 15 missing</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>What causal conclusion follows from these two windows?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">The new rule definitely caused deterioration</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">None yet; different workloads, windows and missingness leave alternatives</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Missing readings are all normal</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Synthetic records and offline models only. No real registrations, notifications, messages or service changes.</small></div>"
