              "eyebrow": "Reliable automation lab",
              "prompt": "Calculate flag rates using observed-reading denominators.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><table class=\"summaryTable\"><caption>Synthetic observation windows Â· missing readings have no known outcome</caption><thead><tr><th>Window</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Flagged count</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>1h Â· 100 observed Â· 0 missing</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>3h Â· 300 observed Â· 15 missing</td><td>30</td></tr></tbody></table><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Window A observed flag rate (%)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Window B observed flag rate (%)</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"\"/></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check observed rates</button></div></div></div></section>",
