              "caption": "Decline account sharing and further transfers, keep relevant messages and use independent help. If an account has already been used, promptly contact the bank through a trusted channel and involve a trusted adult. Do not move unexpected money at a strangerâ€™s direction.",
              "dialogue": "A safe exit does not require another payment.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 31.615,
              "duration": 16.576,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Find a safe exit</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>First payment is not whole-chain verification</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Decline stranger-directed account use and transfers</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Preserve private evidence; seek prompt trusted bank/adult help if used</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
