              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 48.841,
              "duration": 9.6,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the response</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Recruitment chain Â· fictional case</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>C1 Â· reward</span><strong>â‚¹100 task payment in the supplied practice record</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>C2 Â· escalation</span><strong>Deposit â‚¹2,000 to unlock more tasks</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>C3 Â· account use</span><strong>Rent personal account to receive someone elseâ€™s funds</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>C4 Â· onward request</span><strong>Forward â‚¹4,800 and keep commission; source/purpose unresolved</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>The recruiter asks Asha to rent her account and forward funds. What is the safe next step?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-press