                  "success": "Refusal/escalation plan: decline account sharing, credentials and further stranger-directed transfers; if used, promptly contact the bank through a trusted route and involve a trusted adult; preserve private evidence and use official help for suspected cyber fraud. Do not send unexpected funds to a callerâ€™s new refund account."
