            {
              "id": "identity-and-authority-can-be-manufactured-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Identity can be manufactured",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "A profile image, realistic voice or video and a formal title can be copied or manipulated. Two channels supplied by the same claimant are not independent. These observations call for verification rather than proving who created the message.",
              "dialogue": "Familiar appearance is not independent authority.",
              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 14.901,
              "duration": 15.936,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Identity can be manufactured</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Independent identity protocol Â· fictional case</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Claimant</span><strong>Familiar voice/profile/title; secrecy and new verification number</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Known office route</span><strong>Previously saved school careers-office contact</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate contact pack</span><strong>Independently supplied organisation channel</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Partial result</span><strong>Exact identity and request still need independent evidence</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "identity-and-authority-can-be-manufactured-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Triangulate outside the channel",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "End the pressured interaction and use a previously known careers-office route and an independently supplied organisation contact. Compare the exact role and request, protect personal data and record what remains unknown. An unanswered check is not confirmation.",
              "dialogue": "Independence matters more than the number of screens.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 31.487,
              "duration": 16.917,
