              "stage": 0,
              "brief": "For a real Indian financial cyber-fraud loss, immediately contact bank/payment provider through a trusted route and promptly use 1930 or cybercrime.gov.in. Involve trusted adult/school safeguarding help for coercion. Preserve relevant evidence privately without delaying urgent contact. This lesson submits nothing.",
              "eyebrow": "Private evidence and response lab",
              "prompt": "Choose prompt, supportive bank/adult/official-help routes.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab illustratedActivity\"><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-casework-desk.webp\" alt=\"Asha pauses a phone interaction while Kabir traces anonymous payment-reference cards and a teacher points to a separate trusted-contact folder.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\"/><figcaption>Check the requested action through an independent route, preserve private evidence and keep uncertainty visible.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Immediately contact bank/payment provider through a trusted channel for a real financial cyber-fraud loss</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Promptly use 1930 or cybercrime.gov.in for Indian financial cyber fraud, with trusted-adult support</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Seek trusted adult/school safeguarding help for coercion and preserve evidence privately without blame</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Forward the threatened private chat to every class group</span></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Test protection</button></div><p class=\"micro\">Official resources: <a href=\"https://cybercrime.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">National Cyber Crime Reporting Portal</a> Â· <a href=\"https://navimumbaipolice.gov.in/en/citizen/cyber-security\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">bank contact and evidence guidance</a>. The lesson never calls or submits anything.</p></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your prevention and response case file</h2><ol></ol><p>Structured decisions are checked automatically. Your teacher reviews the actual case dossier, team briefing, individual defence and reflection. All records are fictional; no real contact, transfer or report occurs.</p></div>",
