              "eyebrow": "Private evidence and response lab",
              "prompt": "Build a restricted, redacted MOCK case file from supplied facts.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Mock account-misuse receipt Â· fictional case</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Time / amount</span><strong>15:07 Â· â‚¹3200</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Reference</span><strong>DEMO-CF-031</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Observed event</span><strong>Transfer to an unverified beneficiary after a voice demand; identity and scope unresolved</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Evidence handling</span><strong>Restricted originals; redacted classroom copy; no PIN/OTP</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Status</span><strong>MOCK ONLY Â· never submitted</strong></div></div><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Incident time</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose from supplied factsâ€¦</option><option>15:17</option><option>15:07</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Amount in rupees</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose from supplied factsâ€¦</option><option>2300</option><option>3200</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Case transaction reference</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose from supplied factsâ€¦</option><option>DEMO-CF-013</option><option>DEMO-CF-031</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Evidence-supported event description</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Choose from supplied factsâ€¦</option><option>Identity and full scope proven; recovery guaranteed</option><option>Transfer to an unverified beneficiary after a voice demand; identity and scope unresolved</option></select></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Redact unrelated details from the classroom copy and include no PIN or OTP</span></label><label class=\"checkRow\"><input type=\"checkbox\"/><span>Retain relevant originals privately for authorised helpers; do not forward private or harmful material to groups</span></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>Build mock case file</button><p class=\"micro\">Practice only: no report is submitted or contact made. In a real incident, seek prompt trusted help; preserve originals and redact copies rather than destroying evidence.</p></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your prevention and response case file</h2><ol></ol><p>Structured decisions are checked automatically. Your teacher reviews the actual case dossier, team briefing, individual defence and reflection. All records are fictional; no real contact, transfer or report occurs.</p></div>",
              "interactions": []
            },
            {
              "stage": 2,
              "brief": "For a real Indian financial cyber-fraud loss, immediately contact bank/payment provider through a trusted route and promptly use 1930 or cybercrime.gov.in. Involve trusted adult/school safeguarding help for coercion. Preserve relevant evidence privately without delaying urgent contact. This lesson submits nothing.",
              "eyebrow": "Private evidence and response lab",
              "prompt": "Offer help without blame, forwarding or recovery guarantees.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><div class=\"actionBank\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Blame the peer and promise a paid agent will recover everything</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Offer calm support, preserve relevant evidence privately, seek prompt trusted help and reject paid recovery guarantees</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"choice\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Forward the private chat to every group to pressure the caller</button></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check decision</button></div></div></div></section>",
              "evidence": "<div class=\"evidence\"><h2>Your prevention and response case file</h2><ol></ol><p>Structured decisions are checked automatically. Your teacher reviews the actual case dossier, team briefing, individual defence and reflection. All records are fictional; no real contact, transfer or report occurs.</p></div>",
              "interactions": [
                {
                  "type": "ChoiceTask",
                  "choices": [
                    "Blame the peer and promise a paid agent will recover everything",
                    "Offer calm support, preserve relevant evidence privately, seek prompt trusted help and reject paid recovery guarantees",
                    "Forward the private chat to every group to pressure the caller"
                  ],
                  "answer": 1,
                  "feedback": "Support should reduce harm: no blame, public forwarding, recovery fee or guarantee. Use trusted bank/adult/safeguarding and official routes appropriate to the situation.",
                  "success": "Support script: You deserve support; let us contact trusted help promptly and keep the evidence private. Preserve relevant originals, avoid public forwarding or blame and reject paid recovery guarantees. Bank/adult/school safeguarding and official routes remain available; reporting does not promise recovery."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "decisionTask": {
            "title": "Kabir offers help after harm",
            "concepts": [
              "Prompt trusted bank/adult/official help for a real loss",
              "Restrict originals and redact classroom copies",
              "No blame, public forwarding or recovery guarantees"
            ],
            "question": "What helps the affected peer without adding exposure?",
            "choices": [
              "Forward the private chat widely",
              "Offer calm support, preserve privately and use appropriate trusted help routes",
              "Blame the peer and promise guaranteed recovery"
            ],
            "answer": 1,
            "why": "Support should reduce harm. Preserve relevant evidence privately and seek prompt trusted bank/adult/safeguarding and official help without guarantees."
          }
        },
