              "status": "Inspect the case",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 16.469,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-casework-desk.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A pattern needs context</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-casework-desk.webp\" alt=\"Asha pauses a phone interaction while Kabir traces anonymous payment-reference cards and a teacher points to a separate trusted-contact folder.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>Check the requested action through an independent route, preserve private evidence and keep uncertainty visible.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
