t remain visible.</small></figure><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>T02 then T03 through V within three minutes</span><select aria-label=\"T02 then T03 through V within three minutes\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Observed pass-through pattern; intent unresolved</option><option>Supported benign context for one flagged path</option><option>Evidence gap, not proof of wrongdoing</option><option>Reject the allegation; keep a private review signal</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Independent receipt RP1 explains Câ€™s group purchase</span><select aria-label=\"Independent receipt RP1 explains Câ€™s group purchase\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Observed pass-through pattern; intent unresolved</option><option>Supported benign context for one flagged path</option><option>Evidence gap, not proof of wrongdoing</option><option>Reject the allegation; keep a private review signal</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>No independent source-of-funds record for V</span><select aria-label=\"No independent source-of-funds record for V\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Observed pass-through pattern; intent unresolved</option><option>Supported benign context for one flagged path</option><option>Evidence gap, not proof of wrongdoing</option><option>Reject the allegation; keep a private review signal</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>A flag is proposed as a public allegation</span><select aria-label=\"A flag is proposed as a public allegation\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Observed pass-through pattern; intent unresolved</option><option>Supported benign context for one flagged path</option><option>Evidence gap, not proof of wrongdoing</option><option>Reject the allegation; keep a private review signal</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmln