              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><figure class=\"routes\"><figcaption>Two observed synthetic paths Â· arrows show transfers, never intent</figcaption><div><ol class=\"route\"><li><span>X</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><span>V</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><span>Y</span></li></ol><p>T02: â‚¹4,900 at 09:02 â†’ T03: â‚¹4,800 at 09:05 Â· source/purpose unresolved</p></div><div><ol class=\"route\"><li><span>Pool</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><span>C</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li><span>Supplier</span></li></ol><p>T04: â‚¹4,000 at 10:00 â†’ T05: â‚¹4,000 at 10:04 Â· independent receipt RP1 explains a group purchase</p></div><small>No real accounts, account numbers or allegations. Missing context must remain visible.</small></figure><p class=\"scrollHint\">Scroll the synthetic transaction table sideways on small screens.</p><div class=\"tableRegion\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Synthetic transfer evidence\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"table wideTable\"><caption>Whole-rupee, same-day fictional records Â· no real account identifiers</caption><thead><tr><th>Reference</th><th>Time</th><th>From â†’ To</th><th>Amount</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>T01</th><td>09:00</td><td>Recruiter â†’ V</td><td>â‚¹100</td></tr><tr><th>T02</th><td>09:02</td><td>X â†’ V</td><td>â‚¹4,900</td></tr><tr><th>T03</th><td>09:05</td><td>V â†’ Y</td><td>â‚¹4,800</td></tr><tr><th>T04</th><td>10:00</td><td>Pool â†’ C</td><td>â‚¹4,000</td></tr><tr><th>T05</th><td>10:04</td><td>C â†’ Supplier</td><td>â‚¹4,000</td></tr><tr><th>T06</th><td>11:00</td><td>Library â†’ Printer</td><td>â‚¹600</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"callout\">Independent source RP1: Pool â†’ C â†’ Supplier is a documented group purchase. No independent source/purpose or intent evidence is supplied for V. The intended review rule uses a five-minute window and 90â€“100% onward amount.</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Review window in minutes</span><select><option selected=\"\">0</option><option>3</option><option>5</option></select></label><button class=\"secondary\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg>Run transparent pattern rule</button><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Flagged intermediaries under the five-minute rule</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Flagged paths with supplied benign context</span><input type=\"number\" min=\"0\" value=\"\"/></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Meaning of a flag</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option value=\"proof\">Proof of criminal intent</option><option value=\"review\">Private review signal; intent and missing context remain unresolved</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Save cautious pattern analysis</button></div></div></div></section>",
