            {
              "id": "design-prevention-that-can-be-tested-1",
              "label": "Meet the team",
              "title": "A guide must work under pressure",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Kabir prototypes a short verification aid. The first draft says to trust a familiar display name and wait until all evidence is collected before asking for help. Two fictional cases will reveal whether those instructions are usable and safe.",
              "dialogue": "Test the guide, not only its appearance.",
              "status": "Inspect the case",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 15.595,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-evidence-hearing.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">A guide must work under pressure</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-evidence-hearing.webp\" alt=\"Students present a four-part college-fest case dossier at a supportive classroom evidence hearing, comparing a timeline and restricted receipt folder.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A useful case file connects each action to evidence, a responsible role and a stated limit.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "design-prevention-that-can-be-tested-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Two different situations",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The first case arrives before a new-beneficiary transfer. The second begins after a suspected loss with private evidence. A useful aid must support independent verification before payment and prompt trusted help after harm without public forwarding.",
              "dialogue": "Different stages need different next actions.",
              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.245,
              "duration": 16.064,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Two different situations</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Prevention-aid test brief Â· fictional case</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Draft</span><strong>Trust familiar display name; approve first; wait for perfect file; forward screenshots</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>P1 Â· before payment</span><strong>Pause and use a previously known independent route</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>P2 Â· after suspected loss</span><strong>Prompt trusted bank/adult/official help; restricted evidence</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Required record</span><strong>Test before and after revision; peer/teacher reviews usability</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "design-prevention-that-can-be-tested-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Define expected outcomes",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Before testing, the expected outcomes are a pause with an independently known verification route, and prompt bank, adult and official reporting with restricted evidence. Run the draft, preserve its failures and replace ambiguous instructions.",
              "dialogue": "A revision log should show what changed and why.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 32.959,
              "duration": 15.253,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Define expected outcomes</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Define expected safe outcomes for two cases</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Replace appearance-based checking and delayed help</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Preserve before/after results; peer/teacher reviews real usability</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "design-prevention-that-can-be-tested-4",
              "label": "Your decision",
              "title": "Choose the repair",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "Should Kabir keep the familiar-name shortcut, delete the failed case, or rewrite the aid to name the independent route, prompt help and private evidence handling?",
              "dialogue": "A prettier guide does not repair an unsafe instruction.",
              "status": "Decision required",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 48.862,
              "duration": 9.6,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the repair</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Prevention-aid test brief Â· fictional case</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Draft</span><strong>Trust familiar display name; approve first; wait for perfect file; forward screenshots</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>P1 Â· before payment</span><strong>Pause and use a previously known independent route</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>P2 Â· after suspected loss</span><strong>Prompt trusted bank/adult/official help; restricted evidence</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Required record</span><strong>Test before and after revision; peer/teacher reviews usability</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>The weak guide fails both cases. What should Kabir do?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Name the independent route, prompt help and restricted evidence handling; rerun both cases</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Delete the failed case</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Keep the instructions and improve only the colours</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
