              "title": "The college-fest incident",
              "mood": "happy",
              "caption": "Asha and Kabir combine the four Class Twelve modules. A mock portal exposure, an unverified voice request and a changed-beneficiary transfer arrive together. An assistant offers confident advice, while duplicate event content conflicts in the alert record.",
              "dialogue": "Several concerns can exist at the same time.",
              "status": "Inspect the case",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 0,
              "duration": 16.768,
              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-evidence-hearing.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The college-fest incident</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-evidence-hearing.webp\" alt=\"Students present a four-part college-fest case dossier at a supportive classroom evidence hearing, comparing a timeline and restricted receipt folder.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A useful case file connects each action to evidence, a responsible role and a stated limit.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "integrated-case-the-college-fest-incident-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "Four strands of evidence",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The public export setting is confirmed, but complete download scope is unknown. The assistant cites no reliable evidence for the voice claim. The same event ID carries different amounts, and the payment request names an unverified beneficiary.",
              "dialogue": "Each conclusion needs its own supporting evidence.",
              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 17.418,
              "duration": 15.765,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Four strands of evidence</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>College-fest incident evidence Â· fictional case</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Security</span><strong>Public export setting confirmed; full download scope unknown</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>AI advice</span><strong>Voice-authenticity/payment advice has no reliable cited evidence</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>CT record</span><strong>Same event ID carries â‚¹2,300 and â‚¹3,200 versions</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Fraud request</span><strong>â‚¹3,200 to an unverified new beneficiary</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Independent update</span><strong>Original order not yet independently checked</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "integrated-case-the-college-fest-incident-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Assign responsibilities",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "An authorised operator contains the portal exposure and preserves records. The incident lead coordinates verification and support, and the evidence recorder restricts the dossier. Students use prior module work or honestly labelled supplied replacements; no live service is changed.",
              "dialogue": "Name who can act and who keeps the record.",
              "status": "Build the check",
              "tone": "normal",
              "start": 33.833,
              "duration": 17.984,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Assign responsibilities</h2><div class=\"storyFacts\"><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Separate system, AI, algorithm and fraud evidence</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Name authorised operators, support leads and evidence owners</span></div><div class=\"storyFact\" data-active=\"true\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>New order evidence does not verify a changed payment request</span></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
