              "prompt": "Assign responsibilities and assemble a privately labelled dossier.",
              "html": "<section><div class=\"lab senior\"><div class=\"senior\"><div class=\"board\"><fieldset class=\"portfolio\"><legend>Four-strand case dossier</legend><p>Show your earlier records to your teacher or honestly label the supplied case-pack replacements. Source labels and the short reflection are saved with the submitted response in teacher history.</p><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/security-assurance-review?grade=12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open system risk chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Confirmed export exposure; authorised restriction and scope review</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>System risk source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied case pack</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/ai-go-revise-stop-review?grade=12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open ai evidence chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Uncited voice-authenticity claim is unsupported</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>AI evidence source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied case pack</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/retest-after-a-change?grade=12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open algorithm checks chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Conflicting same-ID amounts held; old/new evidence retained</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Algorithm checks source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied case pack</option></select></label></div><div class=\"portfolioRow\"><a href=\"/module/cyber/design-prevention-that-can-be-tested?grade=12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Open fraud response chapter</a><p>Supplied replacement: Tested independent verification and prompt private help routes</p><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Fraud response source</span><select><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Label the sourceâ€¦</option><option value=\"earlier\">My earlier work, to show my teacher</option><option value=\"supplied\">Supplied case pack</option></select></label></div><label class=\"noteLabel\">Dossier reflection for teacher review<textarea maxLength=\"300\" rows=\"4\" placeholder=\"Use fictional details. State evidence, an uncertainty and one improvement.\"></textarea></label><small>Up to 300 characters. Meaning, actual evidence and authorship are reviewed by your teacher; text length is not automatically graded.</small></fieldset><div class=\"board\"><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Restrict portal exposure and retain service records</span><select aria-label=\"Restrict portal exposure and retain service records\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Authorised service operator with incident-lead oversight</option><option>Incident lead with account holder, trusted adult and safeguarding support</option><option>Evidence recorder sharing only with authorised helpers</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Coordinate verification, support and appropriate bank/official reporting</span><select aria-label=\"Coordinate verification, support and appropriate bank/official reporting\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Authorised service operator with incident-lead oversight</option><option>Incident lead with account holder, trusted adult and safeguarding support</option><option>Evidence recorder sharing only with authorised helpers</option></select></label><label class=\"matchRow\"><span>Preserve a relevant private dossier and record unknowns/actions</span><select aria-label=\"Preserve a relevant private dossier and record unknowns/actions\"><option value=\"\" selected=\"\">Chooseâ€¦</option><option>Authorised service operator with incident-lead oversight</option><option>Incident lead with account holder, trusted adult and safeguarding support</option><option>Evidence recorder sharing only with authorised helpers</option></select></label><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Check my map</button></div></div></div></div></section>",
