              "html": "<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-evidence-hearing.webp\"/><div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">The evidence hearing</h2><figure class=\"sceneIllustration\"><img src=\"/cyber-missions/class-12/fraud-evidence-hearing.webp\" alt=\"Students present a four-part college-fest case dossier at a supportive classroom evidence hearing, comparing a timeline and restricted receipt folder.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"788\" decoding=\"async\"/><figcaption>A useful case file connects each action to evidence, a responsible role and a stated limit.</figcaption></figure><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-evidence-hearing-2",
              "label": "The problem",
              "title": "An individual fresh case",
              "mood": "surprise",
              "caption": "The new case includes a documented group purchase that explains one pass-through pattern, but a separate caller asks for a PIN. The receipt supports the purchase context; it does not authorise the caller or make sharing a secret safe.",
              "dialogue": "Keep separate claims separate.",
              "status": "Claim unresolved",
              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 16.97,
              "duration": 14.848,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">An individual fresh case</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Fresh evidence-hearing case Â· fictional case</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Supported context</span><strong>RP1 explains Câ€™s group purchase</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Unsupported allegation</span><strong>A pass-through flag proves intent</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate request</span><strong>Another caller asks for a PIN</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Decision boundary</span><strong>Receipt does not verify caller or authorise secret disclosure</strong></div></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
            {
              "id": "the-evidence-hearing-3",
              "label": "How it works",
              "title": "Defend and reflect",
              "mood": "thinking",
              "caption": "State the decision, cite supporting evidence, consider an alternative and explain what remains unknown. Identify one change that would improve the tested aid. Label prior work and any assistance honestly. The teacher reviews the actual briefing, individual defence and reflection.",
