              "tone": "trouble",
              "start": 51.379,
              "duration": 13.077,
              "html": "<div class=\"storyBoard\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Cyberpur Â· Class 12 private casework desk</strong></div><h2 style=\"margin-top:18px\">Choose the supported decision</h2><div class=\"artifact\"><div class=\"appBar\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-folder-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.7 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v4.1\"></path><path d=\"m21 21-1.9-1.9\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><strong>Fresh evidence-hearing case Â· fictional case</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Supported context</span><strong>RP1 explains Câ€™s group purchase</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Unsupported allegation</span><strong>A pass-through flag proves intent</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Separate request</span><strong>Another caller asks for a PIN</strong></div><div class=\"artifactRow\"><span>Decision boundary</span><strong>Receipt does not verify caller or authorise secret disclosure</strong></div></div><div class=\"board\"><p class=\"storyQuestion\"><strong>A receipt explains Câ€™s purchase, but a separate caller asks for a PIN. What is supported?</strong></p><div class=\"actionBank\"><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Accuse C from the pattern flag</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Share the PIN because the receipt is real</button><button class=\"primary\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Keep the benign context, decline secret disclosure and independently verify the separate caller</button></div><button class=\"primary\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\">Test my decision</button></div><small class=\"note\">Fictional records only. No real transfer, identity upload, external contact, report submission or allegation.</small></div>"
            },
