              "text": "All names, .example domains and DEMO registry references are fictional teacher-created extracts. Compare exact entity, role, channel and offer. Registration checks are not a safety/return guarantee; no real investment product is assessed."
            },
            {
              "line": 130,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Inspect the synthetic offer and independent mock source pack."
