            {
              "line": 130,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Choose a supported pause/reject response to the release-fee demand."
            },
            {
              "line": 131,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "A cloned profile, familiar voice/video or claimed title can be manufactured. Use previously known independent contacts, verify the exact role/request and keep residual uncertainty visible. No real clone, call or ID upload is created."
            },
            {
              "line": 131,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Separate signals from independent corroboration."
