            {
              "line": 135,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Assign responsibilities and assemble a privately labelled dossier."
            },
            {
              "line": 136,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Annual capstone lesson 2 of 2: concise team briefing, individual fresh decision and reflection. A receipt explains one payment path while a separate caller asks for a PIN. Keep supported context separate from unverified authority. Teacher reviews actual briefing, authorship and oral defence."
