              "text": "Four-strand response: authorised containment/preservation and scope review for confirmed export; independent check of unsupported AI voice advice; quarantine of conflicting same-ID amounts; pause changed-beneficiary transfer and seek appropriate trusted help if funds were misused. Each action follows separate evidence, not blanket trust or accusation."
