              "text": "Dossier responsibilities: authorised operator and incident lead handle exposure; incident lead/account holder with trusted adult and safeguarding support coordinate verification and bank/official help; evidence recorder preserves a restricted dossier with accurate unknowns. Four source labels and reflection recorded for teacher review. No live action or report occurs."
            },
            {
              "line": 101,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Team-briefing outline: confirmed facts separate from claims; containment/verification/support with responsible roles; remaining unknowns and an alternative explanation; restricted evidence, follow-up and an improvement action. The actual team briefing is reviewed by the teacher, not automatically graded as delivered."
