              "line": 102,
              "kind": "Exact text",
              "text": "Fresh-case analysis: RP1 supports Câ€™s group-purchase context; a flag does not establish intent; the separate PIN request is unsafe and should be declined/verified independently; the genuine receipt is insufficient evidence of that callerâ€™s identity or authority. Preserve benign context without combining unrelated trust claims."
